"Vrchn\xED vrstva masky p\xE1jky",BottomSolderMaskLayer:"Spodn\xED vrstva masky p\xE1jky",Ratlines:"Vod\xEDc\xED \u010D\xE1ry spoj\u016F",BoardOutline:"Oblast desky","Multi-Layer":"Multi-vrstva",Document:"Dokumentace",Hole:"D\xEDra",DRCError:"DRC chyba",Setting:"Nastaven\xED","Drawing area":"Oblast kreslen\xED","Export area":"Oblast exportu","Create Files":"Vytvo\u0159it soubory","Check your {0}Gerber files{1} carefully before sending them to the factory":"P\u0159ed odesl\xE1n\xEDm do v\xFDroby zkontrolujte va\u0161e {0}Gerber soubory{1}, pros\xEDm.","Download free Gerber Viewer (gerbv)":"St\xE1hnout zdarma prohl\xED\u017Ee\u010D Gerber soubor\u016F","Before generating the Gerber files":"P\u0159ed generov\xE1n\xEDm Gerber soubor\u016F","Please check the packages size and orientation carefully.":"Zkontrolujte velikost bal\xED\u010Dk\u016F a orientaci.","Please check for DRC errors in the Design Manager.":"Zkontrolujte DRC chyby ve spr\xE1vci n\xE1vrhu.","Please rebuild the copper area after modifying tracks and packages.":"Obnovte oblast m\u011Bdi pot\xE9, co uprav\xEDte cesty a bal\xED\u010Dky.","After generating the Gerber file, please use the {0}Gerber Viewer{1} to check whether it conforms to the design requirements.":"Po vygenerov\xE1n\xED Gerber souboru zkontrolujte v {0}prohl\xED\u017Ee\u010Di Gerber soubor\u016F{1}, zda odpov\xEDd\xE1 po\u017Eadavk\u016Fm n\xE1vrhu.","Order at JLCPCB":"Objednat u JLCPCB",Item:"Polo\u017Eka",Value:"Hodnota",value:"hodnota",Unit:"Jednotka","Track Width":"\u0160\xED\u0159ka cesty","Track to Track":"Mezera mezi cestami","Track to Pad":"Mezera mezi cestou a plo\u0161kou","Pad to Pad":"Mezera mezi plo\u0161kami","Hole to Hole":"Mezera mezi d\xEDrami","Via Hole Size":"Velikost pr\u016Fchodov\xE9 d\xEDry","Realtime DRC":"DRC v re\xE1ln\xE9m \u010Dase","{0} is too small!":"Hodnota {0} je p\u0159\xEDli\u0161 mal\xE1!","Invalid DRC Rule":"Neplatn\xE9 pravidlo DRC","Update the symbol's package":"Aktualizovat symbol bal\xED\u010Dku","Invalid Package":"Neplatn\xFD bal\xED\u010Dek","The package's PAD number is different from the symbol's PIN number, e.g. the diode package's PAD numbers are [A,C] but the symbol's PIN numbers are [1,2]. You just need to change one to fit the other. It is case sensitive!":"\u010C\xEDslo plo\u0161ky bal\xED\u010Dku je odli\u0161n\xE9 od \u010D\xEDsla pinu symbolu, nap\u0159. \u010D\xEDsla plo\u0161ky diody jsou [A,C] ale \u010D\xEDsla pinu jsou [1,2]. Mus\xEDte prov\xE9st opravu pouze u jednoho z nich, aby bylo v\u0161e v po\u0159\xE1dku. Pozor na velikost znak\u016F.","Update PCB(Synchronizing PCB from schematics)":"Aktualizovat PCB (Synchronizovat PCB na z\xE1klad\u011B sch\xE9ma)","Hotkey Setting":"Nastaven\xED rychl\xFDch kl\xE1ves","Document Type":"Typ dokumentu",Shortcut:"Zkratka",Function:"Funkce",ALL:"V\u0160E","Rotate selected objects":"Oto\u010Dit vybran\xE9 objekty","Scroll Or Move selected left":"Posunout vybran\xE9 vlevo","Scroll or Move selected right":"Posunout vybran\xE9 vpravo","Scroll or Move selected up":"Posunout vybran\xE9 nahoru","Scroll or Move selected down":"Posunout vybran\xE9 dol\u016F","Cross Document Paste":"Cross document paste","Explore & Find Components":"Prozkoumat a naj\xEDt komponenty","Select All":"Vybrat v\u0161e","Cancel current drawing":"Zru\u0161it aktu\xE1ln\xED n\xE1kres",Save:"Ulo\u017Eit","Drag Tool":"N\xE1stroj p\u0159eta\u017Een\xED","Draw Wire":"Nakreslit spoj","Draw Bus":"Nakreslit sb\u011Brnici",NetLabel:"\u0160t\xEDtek spoje","NetFlag VCC":"Zna\u010Dka spoje VCC","NetFlag GND":"Zna\u010Dka spoje GND","NetFlag +5v":"Zna\u010Dka spoje +5V","Draw Polyline":"Nakreslit spojovac\xED \u010D\xE1ru","Draw Polygon":"Nakreslit polygon","Draw Bezier":"Nakreslit b\xE9zierovou k\u0159ivku","Draw Arc":"Nakreslit \xFAhel","Draw Rect":"Nakreslit obd\xE9ln\xEDk","Draw Ellipse":"Nakreslit elipsu","Freehand Draw":"Ru\u010Dn\xED kreslen\xED","Draw Text":"Nakreslit text","Edit Selected Symbol":"Upravit vybran\xFD symbol","Draw Track":"Nakreslit cestu","Draw Circle":"Nakreslit kruh","Draw Dimension":"Nakreslit rozm\u011Br","Draw Connect":"Nakreslit spojen\xED","Draw CopperArea":"Nakreslit oblast m\u011Bdi","Change To TopLayer":"P\u0159epnout na vrchn\xED vrstvu","Change To BottomLayer":"P\u0159epnout na spodn\xED vrstvu","Change To Inner1":"P\u0159epnout na vrstvu Intern\xED 1","Change To Inner2":"P\u0159epnout na vrstvu Intern\xED 2","Change To Inner3":"P\u0159epnout na vrstvu Intern\xED 3","Change To Inner4":"P\u0159epnout na vrstvu Intern\xED 4","Highlight Net":"Zv\xFDraznit spoj","Place Pad":"Um\xEDstit plo\u0161ku","Place Via":"Um\xEDstit pr\u016Fchod",Measure:"Zm\u011B\u0159it","Change Route Angle":"Zm\u011Bnit \xFAhel cesty","Decrease Routing Width":"Zmen\u0161it \u0161\xED\u0159ku cesty","Increase Routing Width":"Zv\u011Bt\u0161it \u0161\xED\u0159ku cesty","Decrease Snap Size":"Zmen\u0161it velikost uchycen\xED","Increase Snap Size":"Zv\u011Bt\u0161it velikost uchycen\xED","Remove All Copper Area":"Odebrat celou oblast m\u011Bdi","Rebuild All Copper Area":"Obnovit oblast m\u011Bdi","Toggle PCB Net Display":"Zobrazit PCB spoj","New Project":"Nov\xFD projekt","New Schematic":"Nov\xE9 sch\xE9ma","New PCB":"Nov\xE9 PCB","New Spice Subckt":"Nov\xFD Spice Subckt",Modify:"Upravit","Add sub part":"P\u0159idat d\xEDl\u010D\xED \u010D\xE1st",Clone:"Duplikovat","Contribute your components to EasyEDA":"Poskytnout komponenty EasyEDA","Version History":"Historie verze","Edit Project":"Upravit projekt","View Project Page":"Zobrazit str\xE1nku projektu","Download Project":"St\xE1hnout projekt","Reject Sharing":"Odm\xEDtnout sd\xEDlen\xED","Refresh List":"Obnovit seznam","Create New Project":"Vytvo\u0159it nov\xFD projekt","Version Control":"Kontrola verze","Packages Verification":"Kontrola bal\xED\u010Dk\u016F","Reload parts":"Obnovit \u010D\xE1sti",Layers:"Vrstvy","Display Name":"Zobrazit n\xE1zev","Document Recovery Setting":"Nastaven\xED obnovy dokumentu","Maximum backup level":"Maxim\xE1ln\xED \xFArove\u0148 z\xE1lohy","Auto backup(minutes)":"Automatick\xE1 z\xE1loha (v minut\xE1ch)","Save to Server":"Ulo\u017Eit na server","Load from Server":"Na\u010D\xEDst ze serveru","Schematic Library Wizard":"Pr\u016Fvodce knihovnou sch\xE9ma",Style:"Styl",Picture:"Obr\xE1zek","Pin Names":"N\xE1zvy pinu","Please assign the package in the right hand panel after creating the symbol.":"Jakmile vytvo\u0159\xEDte symbol, p\u0159i\u0159a\u010Fte bal\xED\u010Dek na prav\xE9 stran\u011B panelu, pros\xEDm.",Contributor:"P\u0159isp\u011Bvatel",contributor:"p\u0159isp\u011Bvatel",Annotate:"Anotovat",Scope:"Prostor","Active Schematic only":"Pouze aktivn\xED sch\xE9mata","All Opened Schematics":"V\u0161echna otev\u0159en\xE1 sch\xE9mata",Method:"Metoda","Re-annotate all":"Obnovit v\u0161echny anotace","Keep existing annotation":"Zachovat p\u016Fvodn\xED anotaci",Direction:"Sm\u011Br",Rows:"\u0158\xE1dky",Cols:"Sloupce","Order...":"Objednat...","Order your PCB from EasyEDA":"Objednat PCB z EasyEDA","PCB Qty.":"Po\u010Det PCB","PCB Thickness":"Tlou\u0161\u0165ka PCB","PCB Dimension":"Rozm\u011Br PCB","Automatic calculation":"Automatick\xE1 kalkulace","PCB Color":"Barva PCB",Green:"Zelen\xE1",White:"B\xEDl\xE1",Blue:"Modr\xE1",Red:"\u010Cerven\xE1",Yellow:"\u017Dlut\xE1",Black:"\u010Cern\xE1",Purple:"Nachov\xE1",Copper:"M\u011B\u010F",Gold:"Zlato",Silver:"St\u0159\xEDbro","Surface Finish":"Fin\xE1ln\xED povrch","Hasl(Lead Free)":"Hasl (bezolovnat\xE9)","Open Project":"Otev\u0159\xEDt projekt","Shipping Cost":"Po\u0161tovn\xE9","Cost Estimate":"Odhad n\xE1klad\u016F","Actual cost will be confirmed by email.":"Aktu\xE1ln\xED cena bude potvrzena emailem.","Shipping information":"Doru\u010Dovac\xED adresa",Address:"Adresa","ZIP/Post code":"PS\u010C",City:"Obec",Country:"Zem\u011B","After filling out the form above, we will email you with (i) the results of the design rule check, (ii) a quote and (iii) a payment link using Paypal. Shipping is normally one week from receipt of payment.":"Jakmile vypln\xEDte formul\xE1\u0159, ode\u0161leme v\xE1m na email (i) v\xFDsledky z kontroly n\xE1vrhu, (ii) prohl\xE1\u0161en\xED a (iii) odkaz na platbu p\u0159es Paypal. Doru\u010Den\xED obvykle trv\xE1 1 t\xFDden od obdr\u017Een\xED platby.","Restore All Default Shortcuts":"Obnovit v\u0161echny v\xFDchoz\xED zkratky","Save Changes":"Ulo\u017Eit zm\u011Bny","To connect electrical elements, please use Wire (W hotkey) and not Line (L hotkey).":"Pro spojen\xED elektrick\xFDch element\u016F pou\u017Eijte Spoj (kl\xE1vesa W) a ne \u010C\xE1ru (kl\xE1vesa L).","Anonymous File":"Anonymn\xED soubor","Anonymous File can not be cloned, but you can open it, then save it as a new file.":"Anonymn\xED soubor nelze duplikovat, ale m\u016F\u017Eete jej otev\u0159\xEDt a ulo\u017Eit jako nov\xFD soubor.","You must close the file before delete it!":"Soubor mus\xEDte nejd\u0159\xEDve zav\u0159\xEDt, ne\u017E ho sma\u017Eete.",Confirmation:"Potvrzen\xED",Alert:"Upozorn\u011Bn\xED",Information:"Informace",information:"informace",Prompt:"V\xFDzva",Error:"Chyba",error:"chyba","error!":"chyba!",Warning:"Varov\xE1n\xED","Imported ok!":"Importov\xE1no!","Some changes have not been saved.":"N\u011Bkter\xE9 zm\u011Bny se nepoda\u0159ilo ulo\u017Eit.","Your file hasn't been saved. Please save first!":"V\xE1\u0161 soubor nebyl ulo\u017Een. Nejd\u0159\xEDve jej ulo\u017Ete!","Your file hasn't been saved. Are you sure you want to close it?":"V\xE1\u0161 soubor nebyl ulo\u017Een. Jste si jisti, \u017Ee jej chcete zav\u0159\xEDt?","Error! Please try again later.":"Chyba! Zkuste pozd\u011Bji, pros\xEDm.","Are you sure you want to reload this page?":"Jste si jisti, \u017Ee chcete obnovit str\xE1nku?","Are you sure you want to leave this page?":"Jste si jisti, \u017Ee chcete opustit str\xE1nku?","Confirm Reload":"Potvrdit obnovu","Confirm Close":"Potvrdit zav\u0159en\xED","Leave this page":"Opustit str\xE1nku","Stay on this page":"Z\u016Fstat na str\xE1nce","Don't reload":"Neobnovovat","Load failure!":"Na\u010Dten\xED selhalo!","Load projects failed":"Na\u010Dten\xED projekt\u016F selhalo","error info":"informace o chyb\u011B","error information":"informace o chyb\u011B","Guest can't create a new project. Please login!":"Host\xE9 nem\u016F\u017Eou vytv\xE1\u0159et nov\xE9 projekty.","Please create a project before you do this!":"Nejd\u0159\xEDve opravte projekt, pros\xEDm.","Add Part success":"D\xEDl p\u0159id\xE1n","Click the new part and then edit it!":"Klikn\u011Bte na nov\xFD d\xEDl a potom upravte!","Delete my work":"Smazat mou pr\xE1ci","Delete my work. (Only deletes it from this list but not from the server)":"Smazat mou pr\xE1ci. (Odebere pouze ze seznamu, ale nesma\u017Ee ze serveru)","Do you confirm this?":"Chcete to potvrdit?","Delete successfully!":"Smaz\xE1no!","Cloning success!":"Duplikov\xE1no!","Your title is too short!":"N\xE1zev je p\u0159\xEDli\u0161 kr\xE1tk\xFD!","Remove this part":"Odebrat d\xEDl","Find and Jump to ...":"Naj\xEDt a p\u0159ej\xEDt na...","Please type the prefix, such as U1, R1, C1":"Zadejte preefix, pros\xEDm, nap\u0159. U1, R1, C1","Zoom as 1:1, you can print it and then create artwork for etching the PCB.":"Zv\u011Bt\u0161it na 1:1, m\u016F\u017Eete vytisknout a pou\u017E\xEDt pro vylept\xE1n\xED PCB.","Exporting your works!":"Exportuji va\u0161i pr\xE1ci!","Guests can't import a file. Please login!":"Host\xE9 nemohou importovat soubory.","Please create a project before you import a file!":"P\u0159ed importem souboru mus\xEDte nejd\u0159\xEDve vytvo\u0159it projekt.","Import your LTspice file!":"Import LTspice souboru!","Saved successfully!":"Ulo\u017Eeno!","Save failed!":"Ulo\u017Een\xED selhalo!","Can not place parts into this document.":"Nemohu vlo\u017Eit d\xEDl do tohoto dokumentu.","User Package":"U\u017Eivatelsk\xFD bal\xED\u010Dek","System Package":"Syst\xE9mov\xFD bal\xED\u010Dek","File error":"Chyba v souboru","Please save your file first!":"Nejd\u0159\xEDve ulo\u017Ete soubor, pros\xEDm!","Email address is too short!":"Adresa emailu je p\u0159\xEDli\u0161 kr\xE1tk\xE1!","You have not selected a file to upload.":"Nevybrali jste \u017E\xE1dn\xFD soubor pro nahr\xE1n\xED.",Update:"Aktualizovat","No changes":"\u017D\xE1dn\xE9 zm\u011Bny","PCB is the same as SCH!":"PCB je stejn\xE9 jako SCH!","Only public files can be shared":"Sd\xEDlet m\u016F\u017Eete pouze ve\u0159ejn\xE9 soubory","Conversion to PCB has failed!":"Konverze na PCB selhala!","Your username is too short!":"Va\u0161e u\u017Eivatelsk\xE9 jm\xE9no je p\u0159\xEDli\u0161 kr\xE1tk\xE9!","Your password is too short, it must be more than 6 characters!":"Va\u0161e heslo je p\u0159\xEDli\u0161 kr\xE1tk\xE9, mus\xED obsahovat alespo\u0148 6 znak\u016F!","Conflicting shortcut":"Konflikt ve zkratk\xE1ch","There is an empty PCB file. Please first run Convert Project To PCB... from the schematic":"PCB soubor je pr\xE1zdn\xFD. Nejprve p\u0159eve\u010Fte projekt na PCB, pros\xEDm","This file has been modified, are you sure you want to run this simulation before saving it first?":"Soubor byl zm\u011Bn\u011Bn. Opravdu chcete p\u0159ed ulo\u017Een\xEDm spustit tuto simulaci?","Please enter the Maximum Timestep!":"Zadejte Maxim\xE1ln\xED \u010Dasov\xFD krok, pros\xEDm!","Please enter the Stop Time!":"Zadejte Kone\u010Dn\xFD \u010Das, pros\xEDm.","All of these fields are needed.":"V\u0161echna pole jsou povinn\xE1.","Either your spice netlist is too big or the server is busy. Please try again later.":"Bu\u010F je v\xE1\u0161 seznam netlist p\u0159\xEDli\u0161 velk\xFD nebo je server zanepr\xE1zdn\u011Bn. Zkuste pozd\u011Bji.","Your spice netlist is too big! Try breaking your circuit into smaller simulatable blocks.":"V\xE1\u0161 seznam spice netlist je p\u0159\xEDli\u0161 velk\xFD! Zkuste rozd\u011Blit v\xE1\u0161 obvod na men\u0161\xED bloky.","Too many users in simulation. Please try again later!":"P\u0159\xEDli\u0161 mnoho u\u017Eivatel\u016F vyu\u017E\xEDv\xE1 simulaci. Zkuste pozd\u011Bji!","Due to limited server resources, please wait 2 minutes for the interval in every time simulation.":"Kv\u016Fli omezen\xFDm zdroj\u016Fm na serveru je mo\u017En\xE9 spou\u0161t\u011Bt simulaci ka\u017Ed\xE9 2 minuty.","Your simulation results are too large! Try reducing the total simulation time (Stop Time - Start Time), increasing the maximum time step, removing some of your probes or breaking your circuit into smaller simulatable blocks.":"V\xFDsledky simulace jsou p\u0159\xEDli\u0161 velk\xE9! Zkuste sn\xED\u017Eit dobu simulace (Po\u010D\xE1te\u010Dn\xFD \u010Das a Koncov\xFD \u010Das), zv\xFD\u0161it maxim\xE1ln\xED \u010Dasov\xFD krok, odebrat n\u011Bkter\xE9 sondy nebo rozd\u011Blit obvod na men\u0161\xED \u010D\xE1sti.","Demo accounts don't support simulation, please login first":"Demo \xFA\u010Det nepodporuje simulace, p\u0159ihlaste se pros\xEDm.","Please login first":"P\u0159ihlaste se, pros\xEDm","The schematic is showing errors, please check the simulation report carefully!":"Sch\xE9ma vykazuje chyby, zkontrolujte report simulace, pros\xEDm!","Simulation too long, maybe your schematic is too complex.":"Simulace trv\xE1 p\u0159\xEDli\u0161 dlouho, mo\u017En\xE1 je va\u0161e sch\xE9ma p\u0159\xEDli\u0161 komplexn\xED.","Load your preferences success!":"Nastaven\xED na\u010Dten\xE9!","Save preferences successfully!":"Nastaven\xED ulo\u017Een\xE9!","Update subckt ok!":"Aktualizace Subckt v po\u0159\xE1dku!","Please type a new file name":"Zadejte nov\xFD n\xE1zev souboru, pros\xEDm","Create file failure!":"Vytvo\u0159en\xED souboru selhalo!","Schematics and PCBs can't be imported under My Libs folder, please choose a different folder":"Sch\xE9mata a PCB nem\u016F\u017Eete importovat do slo\u017Eky Moje knihovny, vyberte jinou slo\u017Eku.","Libraries to be imported under My Libs folder":"Knihovny importovan\xE9 ve slo\u017Ece Moje knihovny","Please choose only the libraries needed":"Vyberte pouze pot\u0159ebn\xE9 knihovny, pros\xEDm","Maximum import is 200 libs at one time!":"Maxim\xE1ln\u011B lze importovat 200 knihoven.","You libraries will be found under the My Libs folder":"Va\u0161e knihovny lze naj\xEDt ve slo\u017Ece Moje knihovny","Add to Library":"P\u0159idat do knihovny","No items have been checked!":"Nebyly zkontrolovan\xE9 \u017E\xE1dn\xE9 polo\u017Eky!","Nothing was found, please create it for yourself":"Nic nebylo nalezeno, vytvo\u0159te si s\xE1m, pros\xEDm.","Search result":"V\xFDsledek hled\xE1n\xED","At least 3 characters needed":"Je t\u0159eba zadat alespo\u0148 3 znaky","Add to my Favorite Parts":"P\u0159idat do m\xFDch Obl\xEDben\xFDch d\xEDl\u016F","Added it OK. Please find it in your Favorite Parts":"P\u0159id\xE1no. V\xEDce najdete v Obl\xEDben\xFDch d\xEDlech","Please select its parent node":"Vyberte nad\u0159\xEDzen\xFD uzel, pros\xEDm","Libraries can not be exported as active project pdf.":"Knihovny nelze exportovat jako aktivn\xED projekt pdf.","Circuit does not have a GND":"Obvod nem\xE1 GND (uzemn\u011Bn\xED)","Circuit does not have a probe":"Obvod nem\xE1 sondu","Make sure your pin numbers are even numbers":"Ujist\u011Bte se, \u017Ee \u010D\xEDsla pin\u016F jsou sud\xE1","Duplicate Components Prefix":"Duplikovat prefix komponent","{0} exist":"{0} ji\u017E existuje","There are some invalid packages, are you sure?":"Existuj\xED neplatn\xE9 bal\xED\u010Dky, chcete pokra\u010Dovat?","Invalid Characters, library only allows [0-9a-zA-Z-_]":"Neplatn\xE9 znaky, knihovna povoluje pouze [0-9a-zA-Z-_]","Annotation success":"Anotov\xE1no","If you accept this annotation operation, please save your files. If not, close your files without saving.":"Pokud chcete p\u0159ijmout anotaci, ulo\u017Ete soubor. Jinak jej zav\u0159ete bez ulo\u017Een\xED.","This file can't be saved under libs project. Please choose other project or create a new project":"Tento soubor nelze ulo\u017Eit do knihoven projektu. Vyberte jin\xE9 um\xEDst\u011Bn\xED nebo vytvo\u0159te nov\xFD projekt.","Your file is unsaved.":"Soubor nen\xED ulo\u017Een.","You can close the editor now. Have a good day!":"Nyn\xED m\u016F\u017Eete zav\u0159\xEDt editor. P\u0159ejeme hezk\xFD den!","Logout Successfully!":"\xDAsp\u011B\u0161n\xE9 odhl\xE1\u0161eno","You have at least one unsaved file open. Please save it or close it.":"M\xE1te alespo\u0148 jeden neulo\u017Een\xFD soubor. Ulo\u017Ete jej, nebo zav\u0159ete, pros\xEDm.","Please save your file before this operation":"Nejd\u0159\xEDve ulo\u017Ete soubor, pros\xEDm.","Please open a PCB document":"Otev\u0159ete PCB dokument, pros\xEDm","Please save your file before '{0}'.":"Nejd\u0159\xEDve ulo\u017Ete soubor '{0}', pros\xEDm.","Please try again after saving this file.":"Zkuste znovu, jakmile ulo\u017E\xEDte soubor, pros\xEDm.","Connecting to server":"P\u0159ipojuji se na server","Please login before asking for help":"Nejd\u0159\xEDve se p\u0159ihlaste, ne\u017E budete \u017E\xE1dat po pomoc.","This file has been modified, please save it first!":"Soubor byl zm\u011Bn\u011Bn, nejd\u0159\xEDve jej ulo\u017Ete, pros\xEDm!","Remove this param":"Odebrat parametr","Click on an object to select then click on the canvas to place it":"Abyste mohli um\xEDstit objekt, nejd\u0159\xEDve jej vyberte a pak klikn\u011Bte na pl\xE1tno.","Undo/Redo temporary error":"Do\u010Dasn\xE1 chyba pro Zp\u011Bt/Vr\xE1tit zp\u011Bt","We are sorry but EasyEDA is exhibiting an unpredictable error in the undo/redo process. This problem will be fixed soon but in the meanwhile it is safe to continue working on your design.":"Omlouv\xE1me se, ale v EasyEDA nastala neo\u010Dek\xE1van\xE1 chyba v procesu zp\u011Bt/vr\xE1tit zp\u011Bt. Tento probl\xE9m bude brzy opraven, ale te\u010F je bezpe\u010Dn\xE9 pokra\u010Dovat v pr\xE1ci ve va\u0161em n\xE1vrhu.","The schematic has duplicate prefixes of the components, please make them unique. You can check them using the Design Manager.":"Sch\xE9ma obsahuje duplikovan\xE9 prefixy komponent, zajist\u011Bte jedine\u010Dnost, pros\xEDm.","Please click the below help button to find out how to fix this problem.":"Pokud nev\xEDte, jak probl\xE9m vy\u0159e\u0161it, klikn\u011Bte na tla\u010D\xEDtko s n\xE1pov\u011Bdou.","Please create a board outline! Click the help button to find out how to create a board outline.":"Vytvo\u0159te oblast (okraje) desky, pros\xEDm. Pokud nev\xEDte jak, klikn\u011Bte na tla\u010D\xEDtko s n\xE1pov\u011Bdou.","Can not fetch files from server, please check your network and try again":"Nem\u016F\u017Eu z\xEDskat soubory ze serveru, zkontrolujte nastaven\xED s\xEDt\u011B a zkuste znovu, pros\xEDm.","Please open a schematic first!":"Nejd\u0159\xEDve otev\u0159ete sch\xE9ma, pros\xEDm!","Can not find the schematic of this PCB":"Nem\u016F\u017Eu naj\xEDt sch\xE9ma PCB","Anonymous PCB file does not support this operation, please login and save it under your project":"Anonymn\xED PCB nepodporuj\xED tuto operaci. P\u0159ihlaste se, pros\xEDm, a ulo\u017Ete do projektu.","invalid points!":"neplatn\xE9 body!","This file does not support this operation.":"Tento soubor danou operaci nepodporuje.","Net Name Conflict":"Konflikt v n\xE1zvu spoje","Net name":"N\xE1zev spoje","{0} are in the same wire, please remove others and just keep one.":"{0} jsou ve stejn\xE9m spoji. Odeberte je a ponechte pouze jeden.","This field can't be removed!":"Toto pole nelze odstranit!","Annular ring of the pad/via is too small":"V\u011Bnec plo\u0161ky/pr\u016Fchodu je p\u0159\xEDli\u0161 mal\xFD","This project already has at least one schematic sheet. When converting to PCB, EasyEDA merges all schematics under the same project. One project does not allow two copies of the same schematic. Please do not save backups into projects to be converted to PCB.":"Projekt ji\u017E obsahuje alespo\u0148 jeden se\u0161it se sch\xE9matem. Pokud p\u0159ev\xE1d\xEDte sch\xE9ma na PCB, EasyEDA spoj\xED v\u0161echna sch\xE9mata do stejn\xE9ho projektu. Jeden projekt neumo\u017E\u0148uje, aby obsahoval dv\u011B stejn\xE9 kopie sch\xE9mat. Neukl\xE1dejte z\xE1lohy do projekt\u016F, u kter\xFDch budete p\u0159ev\xE1d\u011Bt PCB, pros\xEDm.","Are you sure you want to create a multi-sheet designs?":"Jste si jisti, \u017Ee chcete vytvo\u0159it v\xEDcen\xE1sobn\xFD n\xE1vrh?","Are you sure you want to create a {0}multi-sheet designs{1}?":"Jste si jisti, \u017Ee chcete vytvo\u0159it {0}v\xEDcen\xE1sobn\xFD n\xE1vrh{1}?","EasyEDA does not allow inner board outlines to form cut-outs, please use Fill Region or Hole":"EasyEDA neumo\u017E\u0148uje pou\u017E\xEDt vnit\u0159n\xED hrany desky pro v\xFD\u0159ezy, pou\u017Eijte Pevnou oblast nebo D\xEDry, pros\xEDm.","Please build the copper area! Click the help button to find out how to build the copper area.":"Sestavte oblast m\u011Bdi, pros\xEDm! Pokud nev\xEDte jak, klikn\u011Bte na tla\u010D\xEDtko s n\xE1pov\u011Bdou.","You are advised to set a package for this component now!":"Doporu\u010Dujeme, abyste nastavil pro tuto komponentu bal\xED\u010Dek.","Please select an opened document first.":"Vyberte otev\u0159en\xFD dokument, pros\xEDm.","Some files failed to load. Please reload the page.":"N\u011Bkter\xE9 soubory ne\u0161lo nahr\xE1t. Obnovte str\xE1nku, pros\xEDm.","We are heading to EasyEDA online components store LCSC.com. $10 off (code: WELCOMELCSC) on your first parts order, freight including!":"Sm\u011Brujeme v\xE1s do online obchodu LCSC.com od EasyEDA. Sleva $10 (k\xF3d: WELCOMELCSC) pro va\u0161i prvn\xED objedn\xE1vku d\xEDl\u016F, v\u010Detn\u011B n\xE1klad\u016F na dopravu!",Skip:"P\u0159esko\u010Dit","\xAB Back":"\xAB Zp\u011Bt","Next \xBB":"Pokra\u010Dovat \xBB",Done:"Hotovo","This is the user management menu.":"Toto je spr\xE1va u\u017Eivatele.","This is the toolbar.":"Toto je n\xE1strojov\xE1 li\u0161ta.","This is the navigation list. Under here you can find projects, files, parts and libraries.":"Toto je naviga\u010Dn\xED seznam. Zde m\u016F\u017Eete naj\xEDt projekty, soubory, d\xEDly a knihovny.","Show or hide the toolbar to the top of the window here.":"Zobrazit nebo skr\xFDt n\xE1strojovou li\u0161tu nahoru k oknu.","Show, resize or hide the left sidebar to the left of the window here.":"Zobrazit, zm\u011Bnit velikost nebo skr\xFDt lev\xFD postrann\xED panel k lev\xE9 stran\u011B okna.","Show or hide the right sidebar to the right of the window here.":"Zobrazit nebo skr\xFDt prav\xFD postrann\xED panel k prav\xE9 stran\u011B okna.","Passive Components":"Pasivn\xED komponenty","Power Supply":"Zdroj nap\xE1jen\xED",Diodes:"Diody",Regulator:"Regul\xE1tory",Transistor:"Tranzistory",Transformers:"Transform\xE1tory",Gates:"Br\xE1ny","Vacuum Tubes":"Elektronky",Switch:"P\u0159ep\xEDna\u010De",Relay:"Rel\xE9","Capacitor(US)":"Kondenz\xE1tory (US)","Capacitor(EU)":"Kondenz\xE1tory (EU)","Capacitor(EU)2":"Kondenz\xE1tory (EU)2","Electrolytic Capacitor(US)":"Elektrolytick\xE9 kondenz\xE1tory (US)","Electrolytic Capacitor(EU)":"Elektrolytick\xE9 kondenz\xE1tory (EU)","Electrolytic Capacitor(US)2":"Elektrolytick\xE9 kondenz\xE1tory (US)2","Electrolytic Capacitor(EU)2":"Elektrolytick\xE9 kondenz\xE1tory (EU)2","Inductor(US)":"Induktory (US)","Inductor(EU)":"Induktory (EU)","Potentiometer(US)":"Potenciometry (US)","Potentiometer(EU)":"Potenciometry (EU)","Resistor(US)":"Odpory (US)","Resistor(EU)":"Odpory (EU)","Resistor 45 Deg(US)":"Odpory 45\xB0 (US)","Resistor 45 Deg(EU)":"Odpory 45\xB0 (EU)","Variable Capacitor(US)":"Variabiln\xED kondenz\xE1tory (US)","Variable Capacitor(EU)":"Variabiln\xED kondenz\xE1tory (EU)","Variable Resistor(US)":"Variabiln\xED odpory (US)","Variable Resistor(EU)":"Variabiln\xED odpory (EU)","Variable Inductor(US)":"Variabiln\xED induktory (US)","Variable Inductor(EU)":"Variabiln\xED induktory (EU)",Varistor:"Varistory","Inductor2(US)":"Induktory 2 (US)","Inductor2(EU)":"Induktory 2 (EU)",Battery:"Baterie","Voltage Source":"Zdroje nap\xE1jen\xED","Current Source":"Zdroje proudu","CCCS(Current Controlled Current Source)":"CCCS (Proudov\u011B \u0159\xEDzen\xFD zdroj proudu)","CCCS2(Current Controlled Current Source)":"CCCS2 (Proudov\u011B \u0159\xEDzen\xFD zdroj proudu)","VCCS(Voltage Controlled Current Source)":"VCCS (Nap\u011B\u0165ov\u011B \u0159\xEDzen\xFD zdroj proudu)","VCVS(Voltage Controlled Voltage Source)":"VCVS (Nap\u011B\u0165ov\u011B \u0159\xEDzen\xFD zdroj nap\u011Bt\xED)","CCVS(Current Controlled Voltage Source)":"CCVS (Proudov\u011B \u0159\xEDzen\xFD zdroj nap\u011Bt\xED)","CCVS2(Current Controlled Voltage Source)":"CCVS2 (Proudov\u011B \u0159\xEDzen\xFD zdroj nap\u011Bt\xED)","BV(Behavioral Voltage Sources)":"BV (Behavior\xE1ln\xED zdroje nap\u011Bt\xED)","BI(Behavioral Voltage Sources)":"BI (Behavior\xE1ln\xED zdroje nap\u011Bt\xED)","Epoly(Non-linear Voltage Source)":"Epoly (Neline\xE1rn\xED zdroje nap\u011Bt\xED)","Gpoly(Non-linear Current Source)":"Gpoly (Neline\xE1rn\xED zdroje nap\u011Bt\xED)",Diode:"Dioda","Schottky Diode":"Dioda Schottky","Varactor Diode":"Dioda Varactor",Zener:"Zener dioda","Unidirectional TVS Diode":"Jednosm\u011Brn\xE1 TVS dioda","Bidirectional TVS Diode":"Obousm\u011Brn\xE1 TVS dioda","BJT(NPN)":"BJT (NPN)","BJT(PNP)":"BJT (PNP)","MOSFET(Nch)":"MOSFET (Nch)","Transform(US)":"M\u011Bni\u010D(US)","Transform(EU)":"M\u011Bni\u010D(EU)","Transfrom(NEUTRAL-CTR TAP)(US)":"M\u011Bni\u010D(NEUTRAL-CTR TAP)(US)","Transfrom(NEUTRAL-CTR TAP)(EU)":"M\u011Bni\u010D(NEUTRAL-CTR TAP)(EU)","Mutual Inductors":"Vz\xE1jemn\xE9 induktory","Mutual Inductors2":"Vz\xE1jemn\xE9 induktory2","Or Gate":"Br\xE1na OR","Xor Gate":"Br\xE1na XOR","And Gate":"Br\xE1na AND","Nor Gate":"Br\xE1na NOR","Nand Gate":"Br\xE1na NAND","Not Gate":"Br\xE1na NOT","Xnor Gate":"Br\xE1na XNOR","Tube Diode":"Trubkov\xE1 dioda","Tube Triode":"Trubkov\xE1 trioda","Tube Tetrode":"Trubkov\xE1 tetroda","Tube Pentode":"Trubkov\xE1 pentoda","Voltage Controlled Switch":"P\u0159ep\xEDna\u010D \u0159\xEDzen\xFD nap\u011Bt\xEDm","Current Controlled Switch":"P\u0159ep\xEDna\u010D \u0159\xEDzen\xFD proudem",Fuse:"Pojistka","555(Style2)":"555(Styl2)",Speaker:"Reproduktor","5pin Operational Amplifier":"Opera\u010Dn\xED zesilova\u010D 5pin","3pin Operational amplifier":"Opera\u010Dn\xED zesilova\u010D 3pin","Transmission Line":"P\u0159enosov\xE9 veden\xED",Voltmeter:"Voltmetr",Ammeter:"Amp\xE9rmetr","Opto Transistor":"Opto tranzistor","Keep these fields empty if you just want to build a symbol":"Pokud chcete sestavit symbol, ponechte toto pole pr\xE1zdn\xE9","Need login":"Je pot\u0159eba se p\u0159ihl\xE1sit","Bad password":"\u0160patn\xE9 heslo","We can't find your username or your email, please check it!":"Nem\u016F\u017Eeme naj\xEDt zadan\xE9 u\u017Eivatelsk\xE9 jm\xE9no nebo email.","Make sure your uploaded file size is less than 3MB!":"Ujist\u011Bte se, \u017Ee nahr\xE1v\xE1te soubor men\u0161\xED jak 3 MB!","Bad file type":"\u0160patn\xFD typ souboru","Empty file or bad file type, ensure your file is Eagle 6.0+":"Soubor je pr\xE1zdn\xFD nebo nen\xED spr\xE1vn\xE9ho typu, ujist\u011Bte se, \u017Ee soubor je typu Eagle 6.0 a v\xFD\u0161.","This operation not supported on demo account":"Tuto operaci nelze prov\xE9st v demo \xFA\u010Dtu","Can not share this file under a private project, please set the active project to public!":"Tento soubor nelze sd\xEDlet v soukrom\xE9m projektu, p\u0159epn\u011Bte projekt na ve\u0159ejn\xFD, pros\xEDm!","Login Failed Too many attempts. If you forgot your password, please {0}reset your password{1} or send an email to support@easyeda.com":"P\u0159ihl\xE1\u0161en\xED selhalo kv\u016Fli p\u0159\xEDli\u0161 mnoha pokus\u016Fm. Pokud jste zapomn\u011Bli heslo, {0}obnovte si heslo{1} nebo n\xE1m po\u0161lete email na adresu support@easyeda.com","Common Buttons Setting":"Nastaven\xED tla\u010D\xEDtek","Show/Hide":"Zobrazit/Skr\xFDt","Move Up":"Posunout nahoru","Move Down":"Posunout dol\u016F","Reset All":"Resetovat v\u0161e","Find Libraries...":"Naj\xEDt knihovny...","Place Pin":"Um\xEDstit pin",Permissions:"Opr\xE1vn\u011Bn\xED",Operation:"Operace","Access Control":"P\u0159\xEDstup","Project Access Control":"P\u0159\xEDstup k projektu",Reject:"Zam\xEDtnout","Add User":"P\u0159idat u\u017Eivatele","Bad email address":"\u0160patn\xE1 emailov\xE1 adresa","Can't find this email address in EasyEDA. Your partner must be an EasyEDA user.":"Zadanou emailovou adresu nebylo mo\u017En\xE9 nal\xE9zt v EasyEDA. Ujist\u011Bte, \u017Ee v\xE1\u0161 partner je u\u017Eivatelem EasyEDA.","Grid Background":"Pozad\xED m\u0159\xED\u017Eky","Pane Background":"Pozad\xED panelu","WaveForm Config":"Konfigurace sign\xE1lu","Export Waveform":"Export sign\xE1lu",dot:"te\u010Dka",line:"\u010D\xE1ra","A4 Portrait":"A4 na v\xFD\u0161ku","A4 Landscape":"A4 na \u0161\xED\u0159ku","A3 Portrait":"A3 na v\xFD\u0161ku","A3 Landscape":"A3 na \u0161\xED\u0159ku","A2 Portrait":"A2 na v\xFD\u0161ku","A2 Landscape":"A2 na \u0161\xED\u0159ku","A1 Portrait":"A1 na v\xFD\u0161ku","A1 Landscape":"A1 na \u0161\xED\u0159ku",Landscape:"Na \u0161\xED\u0159ku",Portrait:"Na v\xFD\u0161ku",solid:"pln\xE1 \u010D\xE1ra",dashed:"\u010D\xE1rkovan\xE1 \u010D\xE1ra",dotted:"te\u010Dkovan\xE1 \u010D\xE1ra","Fill Region":"Pevn\xE1 oblast",Type:"Typ",type:"typ","Report error":"Chybov\xE1 zpr\xE1va","Please give us some information to help us find the problem.":"Abychom v\xE1m pomohli naj\xEDt probl\xE9m, pot\u0159ebujeme od v\xE1s n\u011Bjak\xE9 informace.","Cannot place parts into this document: Schematic Symbols can only be placed into a Schematic; PCB Footprints can only be placed into a PCB.":"D\xEDly nelze vlo\u017Eit do tohoto dokumentu. Symboly sch\xE9mat lze um\xEDstit pouze do sch\xE9mat a PCB footprinty lze um\xEDstit pouze do PCB.","Save it as a favorite part":"Ulo\u017Eit jako obl\xEDben\xFD d\xEDl","Only logged-in users can save this component as a Favorite Part but guest (Anonymous) users can place this component into their design directly. Would you like to place this component now?":"Pouze p\u0159ihl\xE1\u0161en\xED u\u017Eivatel\xE9 mohou ulo\u017Eit tuto komponentu jako obl\xEDben\xFD d\xEDl. Host\xE9 (anonymn\xED u\u017Eivatel\xE9) mohou tuto komponentu um\xEDstit p\u0159\xEDmo do n\xE1vrhu.","Electronic circuit design - EasyEDA":"N\xE1vrh elektronick\xFDch obvod\u016F - EasyEDA","Find libs":"Naj\xEDt knihovnu","My Projects":"Moje projekty","My Parts":"Moje d\xEDly","My Modules":"Moje moduly","Assembly LCSC Components":"Komponenty sestaven\xED LCSC",Modules:"Moduly","SCH Modules":"Moduly SCH","PCB Modules":"Moduly PCB","System IC":"IC syst\xE9m","LCSC (Official)":"LCSC (ofici\xE1ln\u011B)","Favorite Parts":"Obl\xEDben\xE9 d\xEDly","Shared With Me":"Sd\xEDlet se mnou",Preview:"N\xE1hled","Preview Window":"N\xE1hledov\xE9 okno","System Default":"V\xFDchoz\xED syst\xE9mov\xE9","User Defined":"U\u017Eivatelem definovan\xE9",Theme:"T\xE9ma","Theme Setting":"Nastaven\xED t\xE9ma",Close:"Zav\u0159\xEDt",Open:"Otev\u0159\xEDt",Collapse:"Sbalit","Toggle toolbar":"P\u0159epnout n\xE1strojovou li\u0161tu","Toggle left bar":"P\u0159epnout lev\xFD panel","Toggle right bar":"P\u0159epnout prav\xFD panel",Reload:"Obnovit","Mouse-X":"My\u0161 X","Mouse-Y":"My\u0161 Y","Mouse-DX":"My\u0161 DX","Mouse-DY":"My\u0161 DY","Bus entry x1":"Vstup sb\u011Brnice x1","Bus entry x2":"Vstup sb\u011Brnice x2","Bus entry y1":"Vstup sb\u011Brnice y1","Bus entry y2":"Vstup sb\u011Brnice y2",Yes:"Ano",No:"Ne",Continue:"Pokra\u010Dovat",Cancel:"Zru\u0161it","Ask a question":"Polo\u017Eit ot\xE1zku","Share my work":"Sd\xEDlet pr\xE1ci","Go to my page":"Zp\u011Bt na str\xE1nku","Bus entry":"Vstup sb\u011Brnice",Filter:"Filtr",Check:"Zkontrolovat","Guest Project":"Projekt hosta","Insert into":"Vlo\u017Eit do","Insert into {site}":"Vlo\u017Eit do {site}","Upload {site}":"Na\u010D\xEDst {site}","Copy the contents of this box into a text editor, then save the file. Paste the edited text back into this box and click Apply to update the display.":"Zkop\xEDrujte obsah tohoto boxu do textov\xE9ho editoru a ulo\u017Ete soubor. Vlo\u017Ete upraven\xFD text zp\u011Bt do tohoto boxu a klikn\u011Bte na Pou\u017E\xEDt pro aktualizaci zobrazen\xED.","EasyEDA format":"Form\xE1t EasyEDA","Copy the contents of this box into a text editor, then save the file with a .svg extension. You can edit it in Inkscape or open it in your browser.":"Zkop\xEDrujte obsah tohoto boxu do textov\xE9ho editoru a ulo\u017Ete soubor s p\u0159\xEDponou .svg. M\u016F\u017Eete jej pak upravit p\u0159es Inkscape nebo otev\u0159\xEDt ve va\u0161em prohl\xED\u017Ee\u010Di.","Content is too big to show, you can download it directly.":"Obsah je pro zobrazen\xED p\u0159\xEDli\u0161 velk\xFD, m\u016F\u017Eete jej st\xE1hnout.","SVG format":"Form\xE1t SVG","SVG File":"Soubor SVG","Description should be no more than 250 letters":"Popis nesm\xED b\xFDt del\u0161\xED jak 250 znak\u016F","The file save operation has timed out. Try again and check your Internet connection.":"\u010Cas pro ulo\u017Een\xED souboru vypr\u0161el. Zkontrolujte p\u0159ipojen\xED k internetu a zkuste znovu.",Notifications:"Notifikace","Please select txt or json files.":"Vyberte, pros\xEDm, soubory s p\u0159\xEDponou txt nebo json.","Failed to read file [{file}]":"Na\u010Dten\xED souboru [{file}] selhalo","[{file}] is not a valid json file":"Soubor [{file}] nen\xED platn\xFD json soubor","Invalid parameters!":"Neplatn\xE9 parametry!",Download:"St\xE1hnout",Start:"Zah\xE1jit","You have unsaved files, are you sure you want to log out without saving the files?":"M\xE1te neulo\u017Een\xE9 soubory, chcete se odhl\xE1sit bez ulo\u017Een\xED soubor\u016F?","Please use the web version to run this function.":"Pokud chcete spustit tuto funkci, pou\u017Eijte webovou verzi, pros\xEDm.","Please save this file to you project!":"Ulo\u017Ete soubor do projektu, pros\xEDm!","Nothing changed":"\u017D\xE1dn\xE1 zm\u011Bna","Delete Node":"Smazat uzel","This layer is invisible.":"Tato vrstva je neplatn\xE1.","When the fill region is NPTH, please set the layer to Multi-Layer.":"Pokud je pevn\xE1 oblast NPTH, je t\u0159eba ji um\xEDstit do Multi-vrstvy.","You should not try to assign a net to a NPTH fill region.":"Nem\u011Bli byste umis\u0165ovat spoj do pevn\xE9 oblasti NPTH.","Net Length":"D\xE9lka spoje","EasyEDA allows you to place a Pin in the schematic, but don't forget to group all of the Pins to a schematic component. Please click the help button to find out how to group them. If you just want to mark the wire, please use NetPort or NetLabel.":"EasyEDA umo\u017E\u0148uje vlo\u017Eit pin do sch\xE9ma, ale ve sch\xE9matu komponenty je t\u0159eba v\u0161echny piny seskupit. Pokud nev\xEDte jak, klikn\u011Bte na tla\u010D\xEDtko s n\xE1pov\u011Bdou. Pokud chcete pouze ozna\u010Dit spoj, pou\u017Eijte Port spoje nebo \u0160t\xEDtek spoje, pros\xEDm.","Coming soon":"Ji\u017E brzy","No tool":"\u017D\xE1dn\xFD n\xE1stroj","Help us translate into your language":"Pomozte n\xE1m s p\u0159ekladem",Pad:"Plo\u0161ka","Via/Hole":"Pr\u016Fchod/D\xEDra","PCB Layers":"Vrstvy PCB","Order PCB":"Objednat PCB",Free:"Zdarma",Small:"Mal\xFD",Medium:"St\u0159edn\xED",Big:"Velk\xFD","Exporting as":"Exportuji jako","Exporting as image":"Exportuji jako obr\xE1zek","Exporting as {0}SVG{1} file.":"Exportuji jako {0}SVG{1} soubor.","Exporting as pdf is recommended: pdf gives good quality printed output and a small file size.":"Exportuji jako PDF: lep\u0161\xED kvalita pro tisk a mal\xE1 velikost souboru.","Generate Fabrication File(Gerber)":"Generov\xE1n\xED souboru pro v\xFDrobu (Gerber)","PenWidth-Increase":"Zv\u011Bt\u0161en\xED tlou\u0161\u0165ky pera","Generate Gerber":"Generov\xE1n\xED Gerber","PCB Details":"Detaily PCB","Gerber View":"Zobrazit Gerber","Dimensions(Estimated)":"Rozm\u011Bry (odhad)","PCB Qty":"Po\u010Det PCB","Copper Weight":"Hmotnost m\u011Bdi","PCB Price":"Cena PCB","Estimated Delivery Time":"Odhadovan\xFD \u010Das doru\u010Den\xED","For your first time order, less than $20 discount on the freight!":"Pro prvn\xED objedn\xE1vku, sleva na dopravu m\xE9n\u011B ne\u017E $20.","HASL(with lead)":"HASL (s olovem)","LeadFree HASL-RoHS":"Bez olova HASL-RoHS","The PCB has {drcErrors} DRC errors.":"PCB obsahuje DRC chyby.","Do you want to check the DRC errors?":"Chcete zkontrolovat DRC chyby?","Check DRC Errors":"Zkontrolovat DRC chyby","Ignore and Continue":"Ignorovat a pokra\u010Dovat","It will then redirect to the web site of a thirdparty JLCPCB with which we cooperate. Are you ready?":"P\u0159esm\u011Brujeme v\xE1s na webovou str\xE1nku t\u0159et\xED strany JLCPCB, se kterou spolupracujeme. Jste p\u0159ipraveni?","Failed to submit your order, please contact us via support@easyeda.com for help.":"Odesl\xE1n\xED objedn\xE1vky selhalo, kontaktujte n\xE1s na support@easyeda.com, pros\xEDm.","@@generateGerber":{Layers:"Vrstvy"},"Create a new Project...":"Vytvo\u0159it nov\xFD projekt","Create a new Schematic":"Vytvo\u0159it nov\xE9 sch\xE9ma","Create a new Schematic Lib":"Vytvo\u0159it novou knihovnu sch\xE9ma","Create a new Spice Symbol":"Vytvo\u0159it nov\xFD Spice symbol","Create a new Spice Subckt":"Vytvo\u0159it nov\xFD Spice Subckt","Create a new PCB":"Vytvo\u0159it novou desku PCB","Create a new PCB Lib":"Vytvo\u0159it novou knihovnu PCB","Create a new Schematic Module":"Vytvo\u0159it nov\xFD modul sch\xE9ma","Create a new PCB Module":"Vytvo\u0159it nov\xFD modul PCB","Export your file, then print it yourself.":"Vyexportujte soubor a pak si jej vytiskn\u011Bte.","Trace width is too small":"Tlou\u0161\u0165ka cesty je p\u0159\xEDli\u0161 mal\xE1","Images Attribute":"Vlastnosti obr\xE1zku","Connect Pad to Pad":"Spojit plo\u0161ku s plo\u0161kou","Copper Area":"Oblast m\u011Bdi",Dimension:"Rozm\u011Br","Please check that you have used Wire and not Line to connect electrical elements.":"Zkontrolujte, \u017Ee elektrick\xE9 komponenty m\xE1te propojen\xE9 spojem a ne \u010D\xE1rou, pros\xEDm.","PCB Fabrication Prices & capabilities":"Ceny a mo\u017Enosti v\xFDroby PCB","Flip all texts on bottom layer":"P\u0159evr\xE1tit v\u0161echny texty na spodn\xED vrstv\u011B","EasyEDA Libs":"Knihovny EasyEDA","Create New Document":"Vytvo\u0159it nov\xFD dokument","General Package":"Hlavn\xED bal\xED\u010Dek","General Packages":"Hlavn\xED bal\xED\u010Dky","favorite Package":"Obl\xEDben\xFD bal\xED\u010Dek","Through Hole":"Skrz d\xEDru","Surface Mount":"P\u0159id\u011Bl\xE1no k povrchu","Markdown Syntax":"Syntaxe Markdown","Markdown supported":"Markdown podporov\xE1n","Read only":"Pouze pro \u010Dten\xED","Read/Write":"\u010C\xEDst/Zapisovat","More Libraries...":"V\xEDce knihoven...","Decompress failed!":"Dekomprese selhala!","Load failed!":"Na\u010Dten\xED selhalo!","Loading...":"Na\u010D\xEDt\xE1m...","No Result":"\u017D\xE1dn\xE9 v\xFDsledky","Place Pin in schematic warning":"Varov\xE1n\xED ohledn\u011B um\xEDst\u011Bn\xED pinu ve sch\xE9matu","EasyEDA allows you to place a Pin in schematic, but don't forget to group all of the Pins to a schematic component, please click the help button to find out how to group them. If you just want to mark the wire, please use NetPort or NetNabel.":"EasyEDA umo\u017E\u0148uje vlo\u017Eit pin do sch\xE9ma, ale ve sch\xE9matu komponenty je t\u0159eba v\u0161echny piny seskupit. Pokud nev\xEDte jak, klikn\u011Bte na tla\u010D\xEDtko s n\xE1pov\u011Bdou. Pokud chcete pouze ozna\u010Dit spoj, pou\u017Eijte Port spoje nebo \u0160t\xEDtek spoje, pros\xEDm.","I know. Do not show this again.":"Rozum\xEDm, ji\u017E nezobrazovat.","Extensions Setting":"Nastaven\xED roz\u0161\xED\u0159en\xED",Remove:"Odebrat",Disable:"Zneplatnit",Enable:"Povolit","(Disabled)":"(Zneplatn\u011Bno)","(Enabled)":"(Povoleno)","Load Extension":"Na\u010D\xEDst roz\u0161\xED\u0159en\xED","Enable or disable will be applied after reload page":"Povolit nebo zneplatnit se pou\u017Eije a\u017E po obnov\u011B str\xE1nky","Your browser cannot run this function.":"V\xE1\u0161 prohl\xED\u017Ee\u010D neum\xED spustit tuto funkci","Extension Files":"Soubory roz\u0161\xED\u0159en\xED","Extension ID":"ID roz\u0161\xED\u0159en\xED","Select Files":"Vybrat soubory",Script:"Skript",Scripts:"Skripty","Script Content":"Obsah skriptu","