letter or a number and can contain only numbers, letters, line-through, underscores, and points. It cannot be modified after saving.":"M\u016F\u017Ee obsahovat pouze \u010D\xEDsla, p\xEDsmena, poml\u010Dku, podtr\u017E\xEDtko a te\u010Dku. Po ulo\u017Een\xED ji\u017E nelze upravovat.","Updating document to new format, please wait......After finishing please save your document with Ctrl + S.":"Aktualizuji dokument na nov\xFD form\xE1t, \u010Dekejte pros\xEDm......Jakmile se aktualizace dokon\u010D\xED, ulo\u017Ete dokument pomoc\xED Ctrl+S.","Open at current project?":"Otev\u0159\xEDt v aktu\xE1ln\xEDm projektu?","Please select a history to recover.":"Pro obnovu vyberte historii, pros\xEDm.",'Be careful! When you click the "Recover" button, this sheet will be overwritten!':'Pozor! Pokud kliknete na tla\u010D\xEDtko "Obnovit", bude tento se\u0161it p\u0159eps\xE1n!',Recover:"Obnovit","Save As a New Project":"Ulo\u017Eit jako nov\xFD projekt","There is no PCB under this project, would you like to create one?":"Tento projekt neobsahuje \u017E\xE1dn\xE9 PCB, chcete jej vytvo\u0159it?","Please make sure that the chose Altium Designer files are saved as ASCII files.":"Ujist\u011Bte se, \u017Ee jsou soubory Altium Designer ulo\u017Eeny v ASCII.","Please make sure that the chose Eagle files are saved in Eagle v6.0 and above.":"Ujist\u011Bte se, \u017Ee jsou soubory Eagle ulo\u017Eeny ve verzi Eagle 6.0 a v\xFD\u0161e.","Please make sure that the Kicad files were compressed as the .zip file.":"Ujist\u011Bte se, \u017Ee jsou soubory Kicad komprimovan\xE9 v .zip souboru.","Open Altium Designer file":"Otev\u0159\xEDt soubor Altium Designer","Open Eagle file":"Otev\u0159\xEDt soubor Eagle","Open Kicad file":"Otev\u0159\xEDt soubor Kicad","Select file(s)":"Vybrat soubor(y)","Append to current project?":"P\u0159ipojit k aktu\xE1ln\xEDmu projektu?",Append:"P\u0159ipojit","Open as new project":"Otev\u0159\xEDt jako nov\xFD projekt","Tip: Press {0}SPACE{1} or {2}R{3} to rotate the placing object or selected object.":"Tip: Stiskn\u011Bte {0}MEZERN\xCDK{1} nebo {2}R{3} pro oto\u010Den\xED umis\u0165ovan\xE9ho nebo vybran\xE9ho objektu.","Hotkeys Setting":"Nastaven\xED kl\xE1ves. zkratek","I know. Don't show this again.":"Rozum\xEDm. Ji\u017E nezobrazovat.","Manufacturer Part Number can not be less than 2 characters.":"\u010C\xEDslo d\xEDlu v\xFDrobce nem\u016F\u017Ee b\xFDt men\u0161\xED jak 2 znaky.","This prefix was changed to non-subpart format.":"Prefix byl zm\u011Bn\u011Bn na form\xE1t pro ne-d\xEDl\u010D\xED \u010D\xE1sti.","Save as New Project":"Ulo\u017Eit jako nov\xFD projekt","Save to Existing Project":"Ulo\u017Eit do existuj\xEDc\xEDho projektu","Sheet Setting":"Nastaven\xED se\u0161itu","Sheet Size":"Velikost se\u0161itu","Invalid Data":"Neplatn\xE1 data",Others:"Ostatn\xED","You are not authorized to share this project.":"Nem\xE1te opr\xE1vn\u011Bn\xED sd\xEDlet tento projekt.","This project is private: if you continue sharing it will be made public.":"Tento projekt je soukrom\xFD: pokud budete pokra\u010Dovat ve sd\xEDlen\xED, zm\u011Bn\xED se projekt na ve\u0159ejn\xFD.","Modify file info":"Upravit informaci o souboru","Please input search keyword":"Zadejte kl\xED\u010Dov\xE9 slovo pro vyhled\xE1v\xE1n\xED, pros\xEDm","Sort By":"\u0158adit dle","Date Created":"Datum vytvo\u0159en\xED","Date Modified":"Datum \xFApravy",Ascending:"Vzestupn\u011B",Descending:"Sestupn\u011B",Stick:"P\u0159ilepit",Unstick:"Odlepit","Expand All":"Rozbalit v\u0161e","Collapse All":"Sbalit v\u0161e","Your file hasn't been saved. Would you like to save it now?":"V\xE1\u0161 soubor nebyl ulo\u017Een, chcete jej ulo\u017Eit?","Don't Save":"Neukl\xE1dat","Library Owner:":"Vlastn\xEDk knihovny:",State:"Stav","Please select!":"Vyberte pros\xEDm!",Route:"Cesta","Import successfully:":"Importov\xE1no:","Import failed:":"Import selhal:","The title must be between 2~128 characters.":"N\xE1zev mus\xED b\xFDt dlouh\xFD 2 a\u017E 128 znak\u016F.","Path only contain 'a-z