de anno",Direction:"Riktning",Rows:"Rader",Cols:"Kolumner",Reset:"\xC5terst\xE4ll","Order...":"Best\xE4ll...","Order your PCB from EasyEDA":"Best\xE4ll ditt PCB fr\xE5n EasyEda","PCB Qty.":"PCB Kval.","PCB Thickness":"PCB Tjocklek","Automatic calculation":"Automatisk ber\xE4kning","PCB Color":"PCB F\xE4rg",Green:"Gr\xF6n",White:"Vit",Blue:"Bl\xE5",Red:"R\xF6d",Yellow:"Gul",Black:"Svart","Surface Finish":"Ytnogrannhet","Hasl(Lead Free)":"Hasl(Ledarfri)","Open Project":"\xD6ppna Projekt","Cost Estimate":"Ber\xE4knad Kostnad","Actual cost will be confirmed by email.":"Aktuell kostnad bekr\xE4ftas med epost.","Shipping information":"Leverans information",Address:"Adress","ZIP/Post code":"Postkod",City:"Stad",Country:"Land","After filling out the form above, we will email you with (i) the results of the design rule check, (ii) a quote and (iii) a payment link using Paypal. Shipping is normally one week from receipt of payment.":"Efter du fyllt i formul\xE4ret ovan, skickar vi dig epost med (i) resultatet av design kontrollen, (ii) en offert och (iii) en betal l\xE4nk till Paypal. Leverans \xE4r normalt en vecka fr\xE5n mottagande av betalning.","Restore All Default Shortcuts":"\xC5terst\xE4ll Alla Standard Genv\xE4gar","Save Changes":"Spara \xC4ndringar","To connect electrical elements, please use Wire (W hotkey) and not Line (L hotkey).":"F\xF6r att ansluta elektriska element, v\xE4ligen anv\xE4nd Ledning (W F-tangent) och inte Linje (L F-tangent).",Confirmation:"Bekr\xE4fta",Alert:"OBS",Error:"Fel",error:"fel","error!":"fel!",Warning:"Varning","Imported ok!":"Inport ok !","Some changes have not been saved.":"N\xE5gra \xE4ndringar har inte sparats.","load failure !":"H\xE4mtnings fel !","error info":"fel info","error information":"fel information","Please create a project before you do this!":"V\xE4nligen skapa ett projekt innan du g\xF6r detta!","Add Part success":"La till del med framg\xE5ng","Click the new part and then edit it !":"Klicka p\xE5 ny del och sedan redigera den !","Delete my work":"Radera mitt arbete","Do you confirm this?":"Bekr\xE4ftar du detta?","Successfully deleted!":"Med framg\xE5ng raderad !","Cloning success!":"Framg\xE5ng att klona !","Your title is too short!":"din titel \xE4r f\xF6r kort!","Remove this part":"ta bort denna del","Find and Jump to ...":"Hitta och hoppa till ...","Please type the prefix, such as U1, R1, C1":"V\xE4nligen skriv prefix som U1,R1,C1","Zoom as 1:1, you can print it and then create artwork for etching the PCB.":"Zoma som 1:1, du kan skriva ut det, och sedan skapa arbete f\xF6r etsning av PCB.","Exporting your works!":"Exporterar ditt arbete!","Guests can't import a file. Please login!":"G\xE4st kan inte inportera fil, v\xE4nligen logga in!","Please create a project before you import a file!":"V\xE4nligen skapa ett projekt innan di inporterar en fil!","Import your LTspice file!":"Inportera din LT fil!","Saved successfully!":"med framg\xE5ng sparat !","Can not place parts into this document.":"Kan inte placera del i detta dokument.","User Package":"anv\xE4ndar paket","System Package":"system paket","File error":"Fil fel","Please save your file first!":"V\xE4nligen spara din fil f\xF6rst!","Email address is too short!":"Epost adressen \xE4r f\xF6r kort!","You have not selected a file to upload.":"Du har inte valt n\xE5gon fil att h\xE4mta.",Update:"Uppdatera","No changes":"inga \xE4ndringar","PCB is the same as SCH!":"PCB \xE4r samma som SCH!","Only public files can be shared":"Endast allm\xE4na filer kan delas","Conversion to PCB has failed!":"Konvertering till PCB har misslyckats!","Your username is too short!":"Ditt anv\xE4darnamn \xE4r f\xF6r kort!","Your password is too short, it must be more than 6 characters!":"Ditt l\xF6senord \xE4r f\xF6r kort,det m\xE5ste vara fler \xE4n 6 tecken!","Conflicting shortcut:":"Konflikt med genv\xE4g:","There is an empty PCB file. Please first run Convert Project To PCB... from the schematic":"Det \xE4r en tom PCB fil. V\xE4nligen konvertera f\xF6rst Projektet Till PCB ... fr\xE5n schemat","This file has been modified, are you sure you want to run this simulation before saving it first?":"Den h\xE4r filen har modefierats, \xE4r du s\xE4ker att du vill k\xF6ra simulering? Kanske spara f\xF6rst?","Please enter the Maximum Timestep!":"V\xE4nligen ange Max Tid steg!","Please enter the Stop Time!":"V\xE4nligen ange Stopp Tid!","All of these fields are needed.":"Alla dessa f\xE4lt beh\xF6vs.","Either your spice netlist is too big or the server is busy. Please try again later.":"Antingen \xE4r din utrymmes n\xE4tlista \xE4r f\xF6r stor eller \xE4r servern upptagen.","Your spice netlist is too big! Try breaking your circuit into smaller simulatable blocks.":"Din utrymmes n\xE4tlista \xE4r f\xF6r stor! F\xF6rs\xF6k din krets i mindre  simulerings block.","Too many users in simulation. Please try again later!":"F\xF6r m\xE5nga anv\xE4ndare i simulering. V\xE4nligen f\xF6rs\xF6k senare!","Your simulation results are too large! Try reducing the total simulation time (Stop Time - Start Time), increasing the maximum time step, removing some of your probes or breaking your circuit into smaller simulatable blocks.":"Ditt simulerings resultat \xE4r f\xF6r stort! F\xF6rs\xF6k reducera den totala simulerings tiden (stopp Tid - Start tid), \xF6ka max tid steg, ta bort n\xE5gra prober eller bryt ned kretsen i mindre simulerings block.","Some unexpected error has happened, please contact us.(http://easyeda.com/cms_files_about-us.htm#ContactUs)":"N\xE5got ov\xE4ntat fel uppstod, v\xE4nligen kontakta oss.(http://easyeda.com/cms_files_about-us.htm#ContactUs)","The schematic is showing errors, please check the simulation report carefully!":"Schemat visar fel, v\xE4nligen kontrollera simulations rapporten noga!","Simulation too long, maybe your schematic is too complex.":"Simulation f\xF6r l\xE5ng, kanske \xE4r ditt schema f\xF6r komplext.","Load your preferences success!":"Framg\xE5ng med h\xE4mtning av dina preferenser !","Save preferences successfully!":"Framg\xE5ng att spara dina preferenser !","Update subckt ok!":"Uppdatering av underckt ok !","Please type a new file name":"V\xE4nligen skriv ett nytt fil namn","Create file failure!":"fel vid skapande av fil!","Libraries to be imported under My Libs folder":"Bibliotek som skall importeras under Min Bib katalog","Please choose only the libraries needed":"V\xE4nligen v\xE4lj endast n\xF6dv\xE4ndiga bibliotek","Maximum import is 200 libs at one time!":"Max inport \xE4r 200 bib vid ett tillf\xE4lle!","Import Libraries success":"Framg\xE5ng med inport av Bibliotek","You libraries will be found under the My Libs folder":"Dina bibliotek hittar du under Mina Bib katalog","Add to My Libs":"L\xE4gg till till Mina Bib","No items have been checked!":"Ingen detalj har kontrollerats!","Nothing was found, please create it for yourself":"Hittar inget, v\xE4nligen skapa det f\xF6r dig sj\xE4lv","Search result":"S\xF6k resultat","At least 3 characters needed":"Minst 3 tecken beh\xF6vs","Add to my Favorite Parts":"L\xE4gg till till min favoritplats","Added it OK. Please find it in your Favorite Parts":"Tillagd OK. V\xE4nligen hitta det i dina Favorit delar","Please select its parent node":"v\xE4nligen v\xE4lj \xF6verordnad nod","Libraries can not be exported as active project pdf.":"Bibliotek kan inte exporteras som aktivt projekt pdf.","Circuit does not have a GND,":"Kretsen har ingen GND","Circuit does not have a probe,":"Kretsen har ingen probe,","Make sure your pin numbers are even numbers":"Se till att pinn nummer har j\xE4mna nummer","Prefix Conflict":"Prefix Konflikt","There are some invalid packages, are you sure?":"Det \xE4r n\xE5gra felaktiga paket, \xE4r du s\xE4ker ?","Invalid Characters, library only allows [0-9a-zA-Z-_]":"Felaktigt Tecken, bibliotek ill\xE5ter bara [0-9a-zA-Z-_]","Annotation success":"Framg\xE5ng med Anno","If you accept this annotation operation, please save your files. If not, close your files without saving.":"Om du accepterar denna anno operation,v\xE4nligen spara din fil. Om inte, st\xE4ng din a filer utan att spara.","Your file is unsaved.":"Din fil \xE4r inte sparad.","You can close the editor now. Have a good day!":"Du kan st\xE4nga editorn nu och ha en bra dag!","Logout Successfully!":"Framg\xE5ng med utloggning","You have unsaved file, please save it or close it":"Du har osparad fil, v\xE4nligen spara eller st\xE4ng den","Please Save your file before the this operation":"V\xE4nligen Spar din fil innan denna operation","Please try again after saving this file.":"F\xF6rs\xF6k igen efter du sparat denna fil.","Connecting to server":"Ansluter till server","You will save your file as anonymous file, do you like to create your own project?":"Du vill Spara din fil som annonym fil, vill du skapa ditt eget projekt","Please login before asking for help":"V\xE4nligen logga in innan du beg\xE4r hj\xE4lp","This file has been modified, please save it first!":"Denna fil har modefierats, v\xE4nligen spara den f\xF6rst!","Remove this param":"Ta bort denna param","Welcome & Thanks for Joining Us! Do you like to create your own project now?":"V\xE4lkommen & Tack f\xF6r att du Ansluter till Oss! Vill du skapa ditt eget projekt nu?","Click on an object to select then click on the canvas to place it":"Klicka p\xE5 ett objekt f\xF6r att v\xE4lja sedan klicka p\xE5 canvas f\xF6r att placera det","Undo/Redo temporary error":"\xC5ngra/G\xF6r Om tempor\xE4rt fel","We are sorry but EasyEDA is exhibiting an unpredictable error in the undo/redo process. This problem will be fixed soon but in the meanwhile it is safe to continue working on your design.":"Vi \xE4r ledsna men EasyEda l\xE4gger ut ett of\xF6ruts\xE4gbart fel vid \xE5ngra/g\xF6r om processen.","Please click the below help button to find out how to fix this problem.":"V\xE4nligen klicka p\xE5 hj\xE4lp knappen under f\xF6r att f\xE5 veta hur du fixar problemet.",Skip:"Hoppa \xF6ver","\u2190 Back":"\u2190 Tillbaka","Next \u2192":"N\xE4sta \u2192","