3y ch\u1EA1y x\xE1c minh quy t\u1EAFc thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n","Apply Changes":"\xC1p d\u1EE5ng thay \u0111\u1ED5i","This is a simple DRC.":"\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 m\u1ED9t x\xE1c minh DRC \u0111\u01A1n gi\u1EA3n","It just can help you to find the obvious errors":"Ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1EC3 gi\xFAp b\u1EA1n t\xECm ra m\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 l\u1ED7i r\xF5 r\xE0ng",Configured:"C\u1EA5u h\xECnh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c","Layer Name":"T\xEAn l\u1EDBp",TopPasterLayer:"L\u1EDBp Paster h\xE0ng \u0111\u1EA7u",BottomPasterLayer:"L\u1EDBp ph\u1EE7 d\u01B0\u1EDBi c\xF9ng",TopSolderLayer:"L\u1EDBp h\xE0n \u0111\u1EA7u",BottomSolderLayer:"L\u1EDBp \u0111\xE1y d\u01B0\u1EDBi c\xF9ng",TopPasteMaskLayer:"D\xE1n Mask Layer Tr\xEAn c\xF9ng",BottomPasteMaskLayer:"H\xE0n d\u01B0\u1EDBi",TopSolderMaskLayer:"M\u1EB7t n\u1EA1 h\xE0n h\xE0ng \u0111\u1EA7u",BottomSolderMaskLayer:"M\u1EB7t n\u1EA1 h\xE0n d\u01B0\u1EDBi",Ratlines:"\u0110\u01B0\u1EDDng bay",BoardOutline:"Bi\xEAn gi\u1EDBi","Multi-Layer":"Nhi\u1EC1u l\u1EDBp",Document:"T\xE0i li\u1EC7u",Hole:"L\u1ED7",DRCError:"L\u1ED7i DRC",Setting:"Thi\u1EBFt l\u1EADp","Drawing area":"V\u1EBD khu v\u1EF1c","Export area":"Khu v\u1EF1c xu\u1EA5t kh\u1EA9u","Create Files":"T\u1EADp tin \u0111\u1EA7u ra","Check your {0}Gerber files{1} carefully before sending them to the factory":"Tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi g\u1EEDi n\xF3 \u0111\u1EBFn nh\xE0 m\xE1y, ki\u1EC3m tra l\u1EA1i {0} t\u1EC7p Gerber {1}","Download free Gerber Viewer (gerbv)":"T\u1EA3i c\xE1c t\u1EC7p ngu\u1ED3n m\u1EDF Gerber mi\u1EC5n ph\xED \u0111\u1EC3 xem ph\u1EA7n m\u1EC1m","Before generating the Gerber files":"Tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi t\u1EA1o Gerber","Please check the packages size and orientation carefully.":"H\xE3y ki\u1EC3m tra c\u1EA9n th\u1EADn k\xEDch th\u01B0\u1EDBc g\xF3i, ph\xE2n c\u1EF1c","Please check for DRC errors in the Design Manager.":"Vui l\xF2ng ki\u1EC3m tra l\u1ED7i DRC trong Qu\u1EA3n l\xFD Thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF","Please rebuild the copper area after modifying tracks and packages.":"\u0110\u1EA3m b\u1EA3o \u0111\u1ECBnh tuy\u1EBFn l\u1EA1i \u0111\u1ED3ng sau khi s\u1EEDa \u0111\u1ED5i g\xF3i v\xE0 d\xE2y \u0111i\u1EC7n","After generating the Gerber file, please use the {0}Gerber Viewer{1} to check whether it conforms to the design requirements.":"Sau khi Gerber \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA1o ra, s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng {0} Gerber viewer {1} \u0111\u1EC3 xem \u0111\u1ED3 ho\u1EA1 Gerber c\xF3 \u0111\xE1p \u1EE9ng c\xE1c y\xEAu c\u1EA7u thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF","Order at JLCPCB":"Jia Li \u0111\u1EB7t m\u1ED9t \u0111\u01A1n \u0111\u1EB7t h\xE0ng",Item:"D\u1EF1 \xE1n",value:"Gi\xE1 tr\u1ECB",Unit:"\u0110\u01A1n v\u1ECB","Track Width":"Chi\u1EC1u r\u1ED9ng d\xF2ng","Track to Track":"Kho\u1EA3ng c\xE1ch d\xF2ng","Track to Pad":"Line \u0111\u1EBFn pad","Pad to Pad":"Pad \u0111\u1EC3 pad","Hole to Hole":"L\u1ED7 \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1ED7","Via Hole Size":"Th\xF4ng qua \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng k\xEDnh","Realtime DRC":"Th\u1EDDi gian th\u1EF1c ki\u1EC3m tra quy t\u1EAFc thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF","{0} is too small!":"Ph\xE1t hi\u1EC7n quy t\u1EAFc th\u1EDDi gian th\u1EF1c = {0} qu\xE1 nh\u1ECF","Update the symbol's package":"C\u1EADp nh\u1EADt g\xF3i thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB","Invalid Package":"G\xF3i sai","The package's PAD number is different from the symbol's PIN number, e.g. the diode package's PAD numbers are [A,C] but the symbol's PIN numbers are [1,2]. You just need to change one to fit the other. It is case sensitive!":"S\u1ED1 g\xF3i pad kh\xF4ng kh\u1EDBp v\u1EDBi s\u1ED1 pin c\u1EE7a t\u1EADp tin th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n.V\xED d\u1EE5, n\u1EBFu g\xF3i diode c\xF3 m\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 pad c\u1EE7a [AC] nh\u01B0ng s\u1ED1 pin c\u1EE7a n\xF3 l\xE0 [1,2], b\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 thay \u0111\u1ED5i b\u1EA5t k\u1EF3 kho\u1EA3ng th\u1EDDi gian n\xE0o, Ph\xE2n bi\u1EC7t ch\u1EEF hoa ch\u1EEF th\u01B0\u1EDDng.","Update PCB(Synchronizing PCB from schematics)":"C\u1EADp nh\u1EADt PCB (Synchronous Schematic v\xE0 PCB)","Hotkey Setting":"C\xE0i \u0111\u1EB7t ph\xEDm n\xF3ng","Document Type":"Lo\u1EA1i t\xE0i li\u1EC7u",shortcut:"Ph\xEDm t\u1EAFt",function:"ch\u1EE9c n\u0103ng",ALL:"T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3",SCH:"S\u01A1 \u0111\u1ED3","Rotate selected objects":"Xoay \u0111\u1ED3 h\u1ECDa \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn","Scroll Or Move selected left":"Di chuy\u1EC3n sang tr\xE1i ho\u1EB7c tr\xE1i \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1ECDn h\xECnh d\u1EA1ng","Scroll or Move selected right":"Di chuy\u1EC3n sang ph\u1EA3i ho\u1EB7c sang ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1ECDn h\xECnh d\u1EA1ng","Scroll or Move selected up":"Cu\u1ED9n l\xEAn ho\u1EB7c l\xEAn \u0111\u1ED3 h\u1ECDa \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1ECDn","Scroll or Move selected down":"Cu\u1ED9n xu\u1ED1ng ho\u1EB7c xu\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1ED3 h\u1ECDa \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn","Cross Document Paste":"D\xE1n ch\xE9o t\xE0i li\u1EC7u","Explore & Find Components":"Duy\u1EC7t v\xE0 t\xECm c\xE1c th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n th\xE0nh ph\u1EA7n","Select All":"Ch\u1ECDn t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3","Cancel current drawing":"Kh\xF4ng m\u1EDF",Save:"L\u01B0u l\u1EA1i","Drag Tool":"K\xE9o","Draw Wire":"V\u1EBD d\xE2y","Draw Bus":"V\u1EBD xe bu\xFDt",NetLabel:"Nh\xE3n m\u1EA1ng","NetFlag VCC":"B\u1ED9 nh\u1EADn di\u1EC7n VCC","NetFlag GND":"B\u1ED9 nh\u1EADn di\u1EC7n GND","NetFlag +5v":"B\u1ED9 nh\u1EADn di\u1EC7n +5V","Draw Polyline":"V\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng th\u1EB3ng","Draw Polygon":"V\u1EBD \u0111a gi\xE1c","Draw Bezier":"V\u1EBD Bezier","Draw Arc":"V\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng cong","Draw Rect":"V\u1EBD Rect","Draw Ellipse":"V\u1EBD h\xECnh b\u1EA7u d\u1EE5c","Freehand Draw":"V\u1EBD t\u1EF1 do","Draw Text":"V\u1EBD v\u0103n b\u1EA3n","Edit Selected Symbol":"S\u1EEDa \u0111\u1ED5i thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn","Draw Track":"V\u1EBD d\xE2y","Draw Circle":"V\u1EBD m\u1ED9t v\xF2ng tr\xF2n","Draw Dimension":"V\u1EBD k\xEDch th\u01B0\u1EDBc","Draw Connect":"V\u1EBD c\xE1p","Draw CopperArea":"V\u1EBD \u0111\u1ED3ng","Change To TopLayer":"Chuy\u1EC3n sang c\u1EA5p cao nh\u1EA5t","Change To BottomLayer":"Chuy\u1EC3n sang ph\xEDa d\u01B0\u1EDBi","Change To Inner1":"Chuy\u1EC3n sang l\u1EDBp b\xEAn trong 1","Change To Inner2":"Chuy\u1EC3n sang l\u1EDBp b\xEAn trong 2","Change To Inner3":"Chuy\u1EC3n sang l\u1EDBp b\xEAn trong 3","Change To Inner4":"Chuy\u1EC3n sang l\u1EDBp b\xEAn trong 4","Highlight Net":"\u0110\xE1nh d\u1EA5u web","Place Pad":"\u0110\u1EB7t mi\u1EBFng \u0111\u1EC7m","Place Via":"\u0110\u1EB7t l\u1ED7",Measure:"\u0110o kho\u1EA3ng c\xE1ch","Change Routing Angle":"Thay \u0111\u1ED5i g\xF3c d\xE2y","Decrease Routing Width":"Gi\u1EA3m chi\u1EC1u r\u1ED9ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng k\u1EBB","Increase Routing Width":"T\u0103ng chi\u1EC1u r\u1ED9ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng k\u1EBB","Decrease Snap Size":"Gi\u1EA3m k\xEDch th\u01B0\u1EDBc l\u01B0\u1EDBi","Increase Snap Size":"T\u0103ng k\xEDch th\u01B0\u1EDBc l\u01B0\u1EDBi","Remove All Copper Area":"Lo\u1EA1i b\u1ECF t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 \u0111\u1ED3ng","Rebuild All Copper Area":"T\xE1i thi\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ED3ng","Toggle PCB Net Display":"PCB Net hi\u1EC3n th\u1ECB m\u1EA1ng","New Project":"X\xE2y d\u1EF1ng m\u1EDBi","New Schematic":"S\u01A1 \u0111\u1ED3 m\u1EDBi","New PCB":"M\u1EDBi PCB","New Spice Subckt":"M\u1EA1ch m\xF4 ph\u1ECFng m\u1EDBi",Modify:"Ch\u1EC9nh s\u1EEDa","Add sub part":"Th\xEAm thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB ph\u1EE5","Contribute your components to EasyEDA":"\u0110\xF3ng g\xF3p c\xE1c t\u1EC7p th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n cho EasyEDA","Version History":"Phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n l\u1ECBch s\u1EED","Edit Project":"Ch\u1EC9nh s\u1EEDa d\u1EF1 \xE1n","View Project Page":"Trang ch\u1EE7 v\u1EC1 k\u1EF9 thu\u1EADt","Download Project":"T\u1EA3i xu\u1ED1ng d\u1EF1 \xE1n","Reject Sharing":"T\u1EEB ch\u1ED1i chia s\u1EBB","Refresh List":"L\xE0m m\u1EDBi danh s\xE1ch","Create New Project":"T\u1EA1o d\u1EF1 \xE1n m\u1EDBi","Version Control":"Ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n","Verify the packages":"X\xE1c minh c\xE1c g\xF3i h\xE0ng","Edit Points":"G\xF3i ki\u1EC3m tra","Reload parts":"T\u1EA3i l\u1EA1i",Layers:"L\u1EDBp","Display Name":"Hi\u1EC3n th\u1ECB t\xEAn","HotKey Sync":"\u0110\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 h\xF3a ph\