Cost Estimate":"D\u1EF1 to\xE1n chi ph\xED","Actual cost will be confirmed by email.":"Ph\xED cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c x\xE1c nh\u1EADn b\u1EB1ng th\u01B0","Shipping information":"Th\xF4ng tin v\u1EADn chuy\u1EC3n",Address:"\u0110\u1ECBa ch\u1EC9","ZIP/Post code":"M\xE3 b\u01B0u \u0111i\u1EC7n",City:"Th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1",Country:"Qu\u1ED1c gia","Tel.":"\u0110i\u1EC7n tho\u1EA1i","After filling out the form above, we will email you with (i) the results of the design rule check, (ii) a quote and (iii) a payment link using Paypal. Shipping is normally one week from receipt of payment.":"Sau khi ho\xE0n th\xE0nh m\u1EABu tr\xEAn, ch\xFAng t\xF4i s\u1EBD ti\u1EBFn h\xE0nh ki\u1EC3m tra DRC tr\xEAn PCB c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i s\u1EBD g\u1EEDi cho b\u1EA1n k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 ki\u1EC3m tra, b\xE1o gi\xE1, li\xEAn k\u1EBFt thanh to\xE1n Paypal qua email","Restore All Default Shortcuts":"Kh\xF4i ph\u1EE5c l\u1EA1i t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 c\xE1c shortcut m\u1EB7c \u0111\u1ECBnh","Save Changes":"L\u01B0u thay \u0111\u1ED5i","To connect electrical elements, please use Wire (W hotkey) and not Line (L hotkey).":"Thay v\xEC m\u1ED9t \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng th\u1EB3ng (ph\xEDm t\u1EAFt L), s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng m\u1ED9t d\xE2y (ph\xEDm t\u1EAFt W) \u0111\u1EC3 n\u1ED1i n\xFAt \u0111i\u1EC7n.","Anonymous file warning":"C\u1EA3nh b\xE1o t\xE0i li\u1EC7u v\xF4 danh","You will save your file as {0}Anonymous file{1}, you must remember the url of the file to find it again after saving. You would better to create a personal project. Would you like to create a project now?":"L\u01B0u t\u1EC7p d\u01B0\u1EDBi d\u1EA1ng {0} T\xE0i li\u1EC7u \u1EA9n danh {1}, b\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 t\xECm th\u1EA5y t\u1EC7p trong t\u01B0\u01A1ng lai v\xE0 ch\xFAng t\xF4i khuy\xEAn b\u1EA1n n\xEAn t\u1EA1o d\u1EF1 \xE1n v\xE0 l\u01B0u t\u1EC7p v\xE0o d\u1EF1 \xE1n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 mu\u1ED1n t\u1EA1o ra m\u1ED9t d\u1EF1 \xE1n b\xE2y gi\u1EDD?","Create Anonymous File":"T\u1EA1o t\xE0i li\u1EC7u \u1EA9n danh","You must close the file before delete it!":"Xin vui l\xF2ng x\xF3a c\xE1c t\u1EADp tin tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi x\xF3a!",Confirmation:"X\xE1c nh\u1EADn",Alert:"C\u1EA3nh b\xE1o",Information:"Th\xF4ng tin",information:"Th\xF4ng tin",Prompt:"L\u1EDDi nh\u1EAFc",Error:"l\u1ED7i",error:"l\u1ED7i","error!":"l\u1ED7i",Warning:"C\u1EA3nh b\xE1o","Imported ok!":"Nh\u1EADp th\xE0nh c\xF4ng","Some changes have not been saved.":"S\u1EEDa \u0111\u1ED5i t\xE0i li\u1EC7u ch\u01B0a \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u01B0u","Your file hasn't been saved. Please save first!":"T\xE0i li\u1EC7u c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n ch\u01B0a \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u01B0u, vui l\xF2ng l\u01B0u!","Your file hasn't been saved. Are you sure you want to close it?":"T\xE0i li\u1EC7u c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n ch\u01B0a \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u01B0u, ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn \u0111\xF3ng n\xF3?","Error! Please try again later.":"\u0110\xE3 x\u1EA3y ra l\u1ED7i! Vui l\xF2ng th\u1EED l\u1EA1i sau.","Are you sure you want to reload this page?":"B\u1EA1n c\xF3 ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn mu\u1ED1n t\u1EA3i l\u1EA1i trang hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i kh\xF4ng?","Are you sure you want to leave this page?":"B\u1EA1n c\xF3 ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn mu\u1ED1n tho\xE1t kh\u1ECFi trang hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i kh\xF4ng?","Confirm Reload":"X\xE1c nh\u1EADn t\u1EA3i l\u1EA1i","Confirm Close":"X\xE1c nh\u1EADn \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\xF3ng","Leave this page":"R\u1EDDi kh\u1ECFi trang","Stay on this page":"\u1EDE tr\xEAn trang n\xE0y","Don't reload":"Kh\xF4ng t\u1EA3i l\u1EA1i","Load failure!":"Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 t\u1EA3i","Load projects failed":"Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 t\u1EA3i danh s\xE1ch d\u1EF1 \xE1n","error info":"Th\xF4ng b\xE1o l\u1ED7i","error information":"Th\xF4ng b\xE1o l\u1ED7i","Guest can't create a new project. Please login!":"Kh\xE1ch kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o d\u1EF1 \xE1n m\u1EDBi, vui l\xF2ng \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp tr\u01B0\u1EDBc ti\xEAn","Please create a project before you do this!":"H\xE3y t\u1EA1o m\u1ED9t d\u1EF1 \xE1n m\u1EDBi tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng n\xE0y","Click the new part and then edit it!":"Nh\u1EA5p v\xE0o th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n con m\u1EDBi \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\xEAm v\xE0o v\xE0 ch\u1EC9nh s\u1EEDa n\xF3","Delete my work":"X\xF3a c\xF4ng vi\u1EC7c c\u1EE7a t\xF4i","Delete my work. (Only deletes it from this list but not from the server)":"X\xF3a t\xE0i li\u1EC7u (ch\u1EC9 x\xF3a kh\u1ECFi danh s\xE1ch, t\xE0i li\u1EC7u \u0111\xE3 kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EF1c s\u1EF1 x\xF3a)","Do you confirm this?":"B\u1EA1n c\xF3 x\xE1c nh\u1EADn c\xE1c ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng?","Delete successfully!":"\u0110\xE3 x\xF3a th\xE0nh c\xF4ng","Cloning success!":"Clone th\xE0nh c\xF4ng!","Your title is too short!":"Ti\xEAu \u0111\u1EC1 t\xE0i li\u1EC7u c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n qu\xE1 ng\u1EAFn","Remove this part":"Xo\xE1 t\u1EC7p n\xE0y","Find and Jump to ...":"T\xECm v\xE0 nh\u1EA3y sang thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB ...","Please type the prefix, such as U1, R1, C1":"Nh\u1EADp s\u1ED1 nh\u1EADn d\u1EA1ng c\u1EE7a thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB, ch\u1EB3ng h\u1EA1n nh\u01B0 U1, R1, C1","Zoom as 1:1, you can print it and then create artwork for etching the PCB.":"Thu ph\xF3ng 1: 1, b\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 in t\u1EC7p, v\xE0 sau \u0111\xF3 t\u1EF1 kh\u1EAFc PCB","Exporting your works!":"Xu\u1EA5t kh\u1EA9u c\xF4ng vi\u1EC7c c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n","Guests can't import a file. Please login!":"Kh\xE1ch truy c\u1EADp kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 nh\u1EADp t\u1EC7p tin, vui l\xF2ng \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp tr\u01B0\u1EDBc!","Please create a project before you import a file!":"Nh\u1EADp t\u1EC7p tin tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi t\u1EA1o d\u1EF1 \xE1n","Import your LTspice file!":"Nh\u1EADp t\u1EC7p LTspice c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n!","Saved successfully!":"L\u01B0u th\xE0nh c\xF4ng","Save failed!":"L\u01B0u th\u1EA5t b\u1EA1i","Can not place parts into this document.":"Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EB7t thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB trong t\xE0i li\u1EC7u n\xE0y, c\xE1c lo\u1EA1i t\xE0i li\u1EC7u kh\xF4ng kh\u1EDBp","User Package":"G\xF3i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng","System Package":"G\xF3i h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng","File error":"L\u1ED7i t\u1EC7p","Please save your file first!":"H\xE3y l\u01B0u t\u1EC7p c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc ti\xEAn","You have not selected a file to upload.":"\u0110\u1ECBa ch\u1EC9 e-mail qu\xE1 ng\u1EAFn",Update:"\u0110\xE3 c\u1EADp nh\u1EADt","No changes":"Kh\xF4ng thay \u0111\u1ED5i","PCB is the same as SCH!":"PCB v\xE0 s\u01A1 \u0111\u1ED3 \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p!","Only public files can be shared":"Ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 chia s\u1EBB c\xE1c t\u1EC7p tin c\xF4ng khai. T\u1EC7p hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i l\xE0 t\u1EC7p c\xE1 nh\xE2n","Conversion to PCB has failed!":"Chuy\u1EC3n \u0111\u1ED5i PCB kh\xF4ng th\xE0nh c\xF4ng","Your username is too short!":"T\xEAn ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng qu\xE1 ng\u1EAFn","Your password is too short, it must be more than 6 characters!":"M\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u qu\xE1 ng\u1EAFn v\xE0 ph\u1EA3i l\u1EDBn h\u01A1n 6 k\xFD t\u1EF1","Conflicting shortcut":"Xung \u0111\u1ED9t quan tr\u1ECDng","There is an empty PCB file. Please first run Convert Project To PCB... from the schematic":'\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 m\u1ED9t PCB tr\u1ED1ng, xin vui l\xF2ng m\u1EDF schematic \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1EA1y "schematic \u0111\u1EC3 PCB',"This file has been modified, are you sure you want to run this simulation before saving it first?":"T\xE0i li\u1EC7u \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c s\u1EEDa \u0111\u1ED5i, b\u1EA1n x\xE1c nh\u1EADn m\xF4 ph\u1ECFng? C\xF3 l\u1EBD b\u1EA1n n\xEAn l\u01B0u n\xF3","Please enter the Maximum Timestep!":"Vui l\xF2ng \u0111i\u1EC1n v\xE0o b\u01B0\u1EDBc l\u1EDBn nh\u1EA5t","Please enter the Stop Time!":"Vui l\xF2ng \u0111i\u1EC1n v\xE0o ng\xE0y h\u1EBFt h\u1EA1n","All of these fields are needed.":"T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 c\xE1c t\xF9y ch\u1ECDn ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ho\xE0n th\xE0nh","Either your spice netlist is too big or the server is busy. Please try again later.":"B\u1EA3ng m\u1EA1ng Spice c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n qu\xE1 l\u1EDBn ho\u1EB7c m\xE1y ch\u1EE7 qu\xE1 b\u1EADn \u0111\u1EC3 th\u1EED l\u1EA1i sau","Your spice netlist is too big! Try breaking your circuit into smaller simulatable blocks.":"Spice m\u1EA1ng c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n b\u1EA3ng l\xE0 qu\xE1 l\u1EDBn, xin vui l\xF2ng chia nh\u1ECF m\u1EA1ch v\xE0o m\xF4 ph\u1ECFng m\u1EA1ch ti\u1EC3u","Too many users in simulation. Please try again later!":"Qu\xE1 nhi\u1EC1u ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng \u0111ang ch\u1EA1y m\xF4 ph\u1ECFng v\xE0 s\u1EBD th\u1EED l\u1EA1i sau","Your simulation results are too large! Try reducing the total simulation time (Stop Time - Start Time), increasing the maximum time step, removing some of your probes or breaking your circuit into smaller simulatable blocks.":"K\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 m\xF4 ph\u1ECFng qu\xE1 l\u1EDBn, h\xE3y gi\u1EA3m th\u1EDDi gian m\xF4 ph\u1ECFng v\xE0 gi\u1EA3m s\u1ED1 l\u01B0\u1EE3ng \u0111\u1EA7u d\xF2.","Demo accounts don't support simulation, please login first":"Kh\xF4ng cho ph\xE9p m\xF4 ph\u1ECFng t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n demo, vui l\xF2ng \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp","Please login first":"Vui l\xF2ng \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp tr\u01B0\u1EDBc","The schematic is showing errors, please check the simulation report carefully!":"D\u01B0\u1EDDng nh\u01B0 m\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 sai l\u1EA7m trong m\u1EA1ch n\xE0y, xin vui l\xF2ng \u0111\u1ECDc b\xE1o c\xE1o m\xF4 ph\u1ECFng m\u1ED9t c\xE1ch c\u1EA9n th\u1EADn, h\xE3y th\u1EED t\xECm ra nh\u1EEFng sai l\u1EA7m n\xE0y.","Simulation too long, maybe your schematic is too complex.":"Emulation timeout, c\xF3 l\u1EBD m\u1EA1ch c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n qu\xE1 ph\u1EE9c t\u1EA1p.","Load your preferences success!":"T\u1EA3i t\xF9y ch\u1ECDn c\xE1 nh\xE2n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n th\xE0nh c\xF4ng!","Save preferences successfully!":"L\u01B0u t\xF9y ch\u1ECDn c\xE1 nh\xE2n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n th\xE0nh c\xF4ng!","Update subckt ok!":"C\u1EADp nh\u1EADt ti\u1EC3u m\u1EA1ch l\xE0 th\xE0nh c\xF4ng.","Please type a new file name":"Vui l\xF2ng nh\u1EADp t\xEAn t\u1EC7p m\u1EDBi","Create file failure!":"Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o t\u1EC7p","Schematics and PCBs can't be imported under My Libs folder, please choose a different folder":"Schematic v\xE0 PCB kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c nh\u1EADp v\xE0o th\u01B0 m\u1EE5c My Libs, vui l\xF2ng ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t th\u01B0 m\u1EE5c kh\xE1c","Libraries to be imported under My Libs folder":"C\xE1c t\u1EC7p th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c nh\u1EADp v\xE0o th\u01B0 m\u1EE5c My Libs","Please choose only the libraries needed":"Vui l\xF2ng ch\u1EC9 ch\u1ECDn c\xE1c t\u1EC7p th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n y\xEAu c\u1EA7u","Maximum import is 200 libs at one time!":"Ch\xFAng t\xF4i kh\xF4ng h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 nh\u1EADp h\u01A1n 200 t\u1EC7p th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n c\xF9ng m\u1ED9t l\xFAc","You libraries will be found under the My Libs folder":"C\xE1c t\u1EC7p th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n s\u1EBD xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n trong th\u01B0 m\u1EE5c My Libs","Add to Library":"Th\xEAm v\xE0o th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n","No items have been checked!":"Kh\xF4ng ki\u1EC3m tra b\u1EA5t k\u1EF3 thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB!","Nothing was found, please create it for yourself":"Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y g\xEC, b\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EF1 t\u1EA1o n\xF3","Search result":"K\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 t\xECm ki\u1EBFm","At least 3 characters needed":"\xCDt nh\u1EA5t 3 ch\u1EEF c\xE1i ti\u1EBFng Anh","Add to my Favorite Parts":"Th\xEAm v\xE0o y\xEAu th\xEDch c\u1EE7a t\xF4i","Added it OK. Please find it in your Favorite Parts":"Th\xEAm th\xE0nh c\xF4ng, h\xE3y ki\u1EC3m tra c\xE1c thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB y\xEAu th\xEDch c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n","Please select its parent node":"xin vui l\xF2ng ch\u1ECDn n\xFAt g\u1ED1c c\u1EE7a n\xF3","Libraries can not be exported as active project pdf.":"Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 xu\u1EA5t t\u1EC7p tin th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n th\xE0nh t\u1EC7p PDF d\u1EF1 \xE1n","Circuit does not have a GND":"M\u1EA1ch kh\xF4ng c\xF3 m\u1ED9t GND","Circuit does not have a probe":"Vi m\u1EA1ch kh\xF4ng c\xF3 m\u1ED9t th\u0103m d\xF2","Make sure your pin numbers are even numbers":"\u0110\u1EA3m b\u1EA3o s\u1ED1 pin c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n l\xE0 s\u1ED1","Duplicate Components Prefix":"Ch\xFA th\xEDch thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB l\u1EB7p l\u1EA1i","{0} exist":"\u0110\xE3 t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i","There are some invalid packages, are you sure?":"M\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 g\xF3i kh\xF4ng h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7, b\u1EA1n x\xE1c nh\u1EADn thao t\xE1c?","Invalid Characters, library only allows [0-9a-zA-Z-_]":"C\xE1c k\xFD t\u1EF1 b\u1EA5t h\u1EE3p ph\xE1p, t\u1EC7p th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n ch\u1EC9 cho ph\xE9p [0-9a-zA-Z-_] v\xE0 c\xE1c k\xFD t\u1EF1 kh\xE1c","Annotation success":"D\xE1n nh\xE3n th\xE0nh c\xF4ng","If you accept this annotation operation, please save your files. If not, close your files without saving.":"N\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n ch\u1EA5p nh\u1EADn ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng ghi nh\xE3n, h\xE3y l\u01B0u t\u1EC7p c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n, n\u1EBFu kh\xF4ng, \u0111\xF3ng t\u1EC7p c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp v\xE0 kh\xF4ng l\u01B0u t\u1EC7p.","This file can't be saved under libs project. Please choose other project or create a new project":"Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 l\u01B0u t\xE0i li\u1EC7u trong d\u1EF1 \xE1n th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n, h\xE3y ch\u1ECDn d\u1EF1 \xE1n kh\xE1c ho\u1EB7c t\u1EA1o m\u1ED9t d\u1EF1 \xE1n m\u1EDBi","Your file is unsaved.":"T\xE0i li\u1EC7u c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u01B0u","You can close the editor now. Have a good day!":"B\xE2y gi\u1EDD b\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\xF3ng tr\xECnh bi\xEAn t\u1EADp v\xE0 ch\xFAc b\u1EA1n m\u1ED9t cu\u1ED9c s\u1ED1ng h\u1EA1nh ph\xFAc!","Logout Successfully!":"\u0110\u0103ng xu\u1EA5t th\xE0nh c\xF4ng","You have at least one unsaved file open. Please save it or close it.":"B\u1EA1n c\xF3 \xEDt nh\u1EA5t m\u1ED9t t\xE0i li\u1EC7u kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u01B0u, vui l\xF2ng l\u01B0u n\xF3 ho\u1EB7c \u0111\xF3ng n\xF3","Please save your file before this operation":"Vui l\xF2ng l\u01B0u v\u0103n b\u1EA3n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c","Please open a PCB document":"Xin vui l\xF2ng m\u1EDF m\u1ED9t t\xE0i li\u1EC7u PCB","Please save your file before '{0}'.":"Vui l\xF2ng l\u01B0u t\u1EC7p c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n {0}","Please try again after saving this file.":"L\u01B0u t\xE0i li\u1EC7u v\xE0 th\u1EED l\u1EA1i","Connecting to server":"K\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i v\u1EDBi m\xE1y ch\u1EE7","Please login before asking for help":"Vui l\xF2ng \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi y\xEAu c\u1EA7u tr\u1EE3 gi\xFAp","This file has been modified, please save it first!":"T\xE0i li\u1EC7u n\xE0y \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c s\u1EEDa \u0111\u1ED5i, xin l\u01B0u tr\u01B0\u1EDBc!","Remove this param":"Lo\u1EA1i b\u1ECF tham s\u1ED1 n\xE0y","Click on an object to select then click on the canvas to place it":"Nh\u1EA5p \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1ECDn thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB, sau \u0111\xF3 nh\u1EA5p v\xE0o v\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EB7t thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB","Undo/Redo temporary error":"Ho\xE0n t\xE1c / l\xE0m l\u1EA1i l\u1ED7i t\u1EA1m th\u1EDDi","We are sorry but EasyEDA is exhibiting an unpredictable error in the undo/redo process. This problem will be fixed soon but in the meanwhile it is safe to continue working on your design.":"Ho\xE0n t\xE1c l\xE0m l\u1EA1i l\u1ED7i t\u1EA1m th\u1EDDi kh\xF4ng d\u1EF1 \u0111o\xE1n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c, ch\xFAng t\xF4i s\u1EBD kh\u1EAFc ph\u1EE5c s\u1EF1 c\u1ED1 c\xE0ng s\u1EDBm c\xE0ng t\u1ED1t v\xE0 c\xF4ng vi\u1EC7c thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n an to\xE0n, b\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 y\xEAn t\xE2m r\u1EB1ng ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c l\xE0m vi\u1EC7c","The schematic has duplicate prefixes of the components, please make them unique. You can check them using the Design Manager.":"C\xF3 m\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 ph\u1EA7n tr\xF9ng l\u1EB7p cho s\u01A1 \u0111\u1ED3 hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i, s\u1EEDa \u0111\u1ED5i ch\xFAng v\xE0 \u0111\u1EA3m b\u1EA3o ch\xFAng l\xE0 duy nh\u1EA5t. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 xem ch\xFAng trong Qu\u1EA3n l\xFD Thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF","Please click the below help button to find out how to fix this problem.":"Vui l\xF2ng nh\u1EA5p v\xE0o n\xFAt tr\u1EE3 gi\xFAp b\xEAn d\u01B0\u1EDBi \u0111\u1EC3 t\xECm hi\u1EC3u c\xE1ch kh\u1EAFc ph\u1EE5c l\u1ED7i n\xE0y","Please create a board outline! Click the help button to find out how to create a board outline.":"Xin vui l\xF2ng t\u1EA1o ra m\u1ED9t bi\xEAn gi\u1EDBi PCB \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn v\xE0 nh\u1EA5p v\xE0o n\xFAt Tr\u1EE3 gi\xFAp \u0111\u1EC3 t\xECm hi\u1EC3u l\xE0m th\u1EBF n\xE0o \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o ra m\u1ED9t bi\xEAn gi\u1EDBi PCB","Can not fetch files from server, please check your network and try again":"Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 th\u1EED l\u1EA1i sau khi ki\u1EC3m tra m\u1EA1ng t\u1EEB m\xE1y ch\u1EE7 ho\u1EB7c t\xE0i li\u1EC7u","Please open a schematic first!":"Xin vui l\xF2ng m\u1EDF m\u1ED9t schematic.","Can not find the schematic of this PCB":"Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 t\xECm schematic c\u1EE7a PCB n\xE0y","invalid points!":"Ch\u1EE9a c\xE1c \u0111i\u1EC3m t\u1ECDa \u0111\u1ED9 kh\xF4ng h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7","This file does not support this operation.":"T\xE0i li\u1EC7u n\xE0y kh\xF4ng h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng n\xE0y","Net Name Conflict":"M\xE2u thu\u1EABn v\u1EC1 t\xEAn m\u1EA1ng","Net name":"T\xEAn m\u1EA1ng","{0} are in the same wire, please remove others and just keep one.":"{0} Trong c\xF9ng m\u1ED9t d\xE2y, xin vui l\xF2ng x\xF3a c\xE1c kh\xE1c, ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1EA1i m\u1ED9t","This field can't be removed!":"Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 t\xECm th\u1EA5y PCB t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u1EE9ngbschematic","Annular ring of the pad/via is too small":"Conductive l\u1ED7 ho\u1EB7c l\u1ED7 c\u1EAFm m\u1ED9t v\xF2ng h\xE0n \u0111\u01A1n l\xE0 qu\xE1 nh\u1ECF","This project already has at least one schematic sheet. When converting to PCB, EasyEDA merges all schematics under the same project. One project does not allow two copies of the same schematic. Please do not save backups into projects to be converted to PCB.":"D\u1EF1 \xE1n c\xF3 \xEDt nh\u1EA5t m\u1ED9t s\u01A1 \u0111\u1ED3. Khi chuy\u1EC3n sang PCB, EasyEDA h\u1EE3p nh\u1EA5t t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 c\xE1c s\u01A1 \u0111\u1ED3 theo d\u1EF1 \xE1n. C\xF9ng m\u1ED9t d\u1EF1 \xE1n kh\xF4ng cho ph\xE9p hai c\xF9ng m\u1ED9t s\u01A1 \u0111\u1ED3.","Are you sure you want to create a multi-sheet designs?":"B\u1EA1n c\xF3 ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn mu\u1ED1n t\u1EA1o m\u1ED9t d\u1EF1 \xE1n nhi\u1EC1u trang s\u01A1 \u0111\u1ED3?","Are you sure you want to create a {0}multi-sheet designs{1}?":"B\u1EA1n c\xF3 ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn mu\u1ED1n t\u1EA1o m\u1ED9t {0} D\u1EF1 \xE1n Nhi\u1EC1u Trang Schematic {1}?","EasyEDA does not allow inner board outlines to form cut-outs, please use Fill Region or Hole":"EDA kh\xF4ng cho ph\xE9p khoan l\u1ED7, thay v\xE0o \u0111\xF3 s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng c\xE1c l\u1ED7 ho\u1EB7c l\u1ED7 \u0111\u1EB7c","Please build the copper area! Click the help button to find out how to build the copper area.":"Vui l\xF2ng x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng l\u1EA1i l\u1EDBp \u0111\u1ED3ng, nh\u1EA5p v\xE0o n\xFAt tr\u1EE3 gi\xFAp \u0111\u1EC3 bi\u1EBFt th\xEAm th\xF4ng tin","You are advised to set a package for this component now!":"B\u1EA1n c\u1EA7n ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EB7t g\xF3i cho ph\u1EA7n n\xE0y!","Please select an opened document first.":"Tr\u01B0\u1EDBc ti\xEAn h\xE3y ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t t\xE0i li\u1EC7u m\u1EDF","Some files failed to load. Please reload the page.":"T\u1EA3i t\u1EC7p t\u1EEBng ph\u1EA7n kh\xF4ng th\xE0nh c\xF4ng, vui l\xF2ng t\u1EA3i l\u1EA1i trang.",Skip:"B\u1ECF qua","\xAB Back":"\xABTr\u01B0\u1EDBc","Next \xBB":"Ti\u1EBFp theo \xBB",Done:"Ho\xE0n th\xE0nh","This is the user management menu.":"\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 menu ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng","This is the toolbar.":"\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 thanh c\xF4ng c\u1EE5 h\xE0ng \u0111\u1EA7u","This is the navigation list. Under here you can find projects, files, parts and libraries.":"\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC1u h\u01B0\u1EDBng t\xE0i li\u1EC7u, xem c\xE1c d\u1EF1 \xE1n, t\xE0i li\u1EC7u, th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y.","Show or hide the toolbar to the top of the window here.":"\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 thanh c\xF4ng c\u1EE5 tr\xEAn c\xF9ng","Show, resize or hide the left sidebar to the left of the window here.":"\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 c\xF4ng t\u1EAFc b\u1EADt t\u1EAFt b\xEAn tr\xE1i","Show or hide the right sidebar to the right of the window here.":"\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 c\xF4ng t\u1EAFc b\u1EADt t\u1EAFt b\xEAn ph\u1EA3i","Passive Components":"Thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB th\u1EE5 \u0111\u1ED9ng","Power Supply":"\u0110i\u1EC7n",Diodes:"\u0110i\u1ED1t",Regulator:"B\u1ED9 \u0111i\u1EC1u ch\u1EC9nh",Transistor:"B\xF3ng b\xE1n d\u1EABn",Transformers:"Bi\u1EBFn \xE1p",Gates:"C\u1ED5ng logic","Vacuum Tubes":"\u1ED0ng ch\xE2n kh\xF4ng",Switch:"Chuy\u1EC3n \u0111\u1ED5i",Relay:"Chuy\u1EC3n ti\u1EBFp","Capacitor(US)":"T\u1EE5 (M\u1EF9)","Capacitor(EU)":"T\u1EE5 (Ch\xE2u \xC2u)","Capacitor(EU)2":"T\u1EE5 (Ch\xE2u \xC2u)2","Electrolytic Capacitor(US)":"T\u1EE5 \u0111i\u1EC7n \u0111i\u1EC7n (M\u1EF9)","Electrolytic Capacitor(EU)":"T\u1EE5 \u0111i\u1EC7n \u0111i\u1EC7n (Ch\xE2u \xC2u)","Electrolytic Capacitor(US)2":"T\u1EE5 \u0111i\u1EC7n \u0111i\u1EC7n (M\u1EF9)2","Electrolytic Capacitor(EU)2":"T\u1EE5 \u0111i\u1EC7n \u0111i\u1EC7n (Ch\xE2u \xC2u)2","Inductor(US)":"T\u1EF1 c\u1EA3m (M\u1EF9)","Inductor(EU)":"T\u1EF1 c\u1EA3m (Ch\xE2u \xC2u)","Potentiometer(US)":"Chi\u1EBFt \xE1p (M\u1EF9)","Potentiometer(EU)":"Chi\u1EBFt \xE1p (ch\xE2u \xC2u)","Resistor(US)":"\u0110i\u1EC7n tr\u1EDF (M\u1EF9)","Resistor(EU)":"\u0110i\u1EC7n tr\u1EDF (ch\xE2u \xC2u)","Resistor 45 Deg(US)":"45 \u0111\u1ED9 kh\xE1ng (M\u1EF9)","Resistor 45 Deg(EU)":"45 \u0111\u1ED9 kh\xE1ng (ch\xE2u \xC2u)","Variable Capacitor(US)":"\u0110i\u1EC1u ch\u1EC9nh dung (M\u1EF9)","Variable Capacitor(EU)":"\u0110i\u1EC1u ch\u1EC9nh dung (ch\xE2u \xC2u)","Variable Resistor(US)":"\u0110i\u1EC1u ch\u1EC9nh \u0111i\u1EC7n tr\u1EDF (M\u1EF9)","Variable Resistor(EU)":"\u0110i\u1EC1u ch\u1EC9nh \u0111i\u1EC7n tr\u1EDF (ch\xE2u \xC2u)","Variable Inductor(US)":"\u0110i\u1EC1u ch\u1EC9nh \u0111\u1ED9 t\u1EF1 c\u1EA3m (M\u1EF9)","Variable Inductor(EU)":"\u0110i\u1EC1u ch\u1EC9nh \u0111\u1ED9 t\u1EF1 c\u1EA3m (ch\xE2u \xC2u)","Inductor2(US)":"\u0110i\u1EC7n c\u1EA3m 2 (M\u1EF9)","Inductor2(EU)":"\u0110i\u1EC7n c\u1EA3m 2 (ch\xE2u \xC2u)",Battery:"Pin","Voltage Source":"Ngu\u1ED3n \u0111i\u1EC7n \xE1p","Current Source":"Hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i ngu\u1ED3n","CCCS(Current Controlled Current Source)":"CCCS (hi\u1EC7n nay ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i ngu\u1ED3n)","CCCS2(Current Controlled Current Source)":"CCCS (hi\u1EC7n nay ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i ngu\u1ED3n)","VCCS(Voltage Controlled Current Source)":"VCCS (ngu\u1ED3n \u0111i\u1EC7n \xE1p ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t)","VCVS(Voltage Controlled Voltage Source)":"VCVS (\u0110i\u1EC7n \xE1p \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n \u0111i\u1EC7n \xE1p)","CCVS(Current Controlled Voltage Source)":"CCVS (ngu\u1ED3n \u0111i\u1EC7n \xE1p ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i)","CCVS2(Current Controlled Voltage Source)":"CCVS2 (ngu\u1ED3n \u0111i\u1EC7n \xE1p ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i)","BV(Behavioral Voltage Sources)":"BV (Ngu\u1ED3n \u0111i\u1EC7n \xE1p h\xE0nh vi)","BI(Behavioral Voltage Sources)":"BI (Ngu\u1ED3n \u0111i\u1EC7n \xE1p h\xE0nh vi)","Epoly(Non-linear Voltage Source)":"Epoly (ngu\u1ED3n \u0111i\u1EC7n \xE1p phi tuy\u1EBFn t\xEDnh)","Gpoly(Non-linear Current Source)":"Gpoly (ngu\u1ED3n kh\xF4ng tuy\u1EBFn t\xEDnh)","Schottky Diode":"Diode Schottky","Varactor Diode":"Diode Varactor","Unidirectional TVS Diode":"Diode TVS v\xF4 h\u01B0\u1EDBng","Bidirectional TVS Diode":"Di truy\u1EC1n TVS hai chi\u1EC1u",Diac:"Diode k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t hai chi\u1EC1u",Bridge:"C\u1EA7u ch\u1EC9nh l\u01B0u","BJT(NPN)":"Transistor (NPN)","BJT(PNP)":"Transistor (PNP)","MESFET(Pch)":"MESFET(Pch","Transform(EU)":"Transform(EU","Mutual Inductors":"Cu\u1ED9n c\u1EA3m t\u01B0\u01A1ng h\u1ED7","Mutual Inductors2":"Cu\u1ED9n c\u1EA3m t\u01B0\u01A1ng h\u1ED7 2","Voltage Controlled Switch":"\u0110i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n \u0111i\u1EC7n \xE1p","Current Controlled Switch":"Ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i Switch",Fuse:"C\u1EA7u ch\xEC","555(Style2)":"555 gi\u1EDD (Style2)",Speaker:"Loa","5pin Operational Amplifier":"5-\u0111\u1EA7u cu\u1ED1i op amp","3pin Operational amplifier":"3-\u0111\u1EA7u cu\u1ED1i op amp","Transmission Line":"\u0110\u01B0\u1EDDng d\xE2y truy\u1EC1n t\u1EA3i",Voltmeter:"V\xF4n k\u1EBF",Ammeter:"Ampe k\u1EBF",LAMP:"B\xF3ng \u0111\xE8n","Opto Transistor":"Phototransistor","Keep these fields empty if you just want to build a symbol":"N\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n ch\u1EC9 mu\u1ED1n t\u1EA1o m\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 nh\u1EADn d\u1EA1ng, h\xE3y \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u1ED1ng bi\u1EC3u m\u1EABu \u1EDF tr\xEAn","Need login":"C\u1EA7n ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp","Bad password":"M\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u sai","We can't find your username or your email, please check it!":"Ch\xFAng t\xF4i kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 t\xECm th\u1EA5y t\xEAn ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng ho\u1EB7c email n\xE0y, vui l\xF2ng ki\u1EC3m tra l\u1EA1i","Make sure your uploaded file size is less than 3MB!":"Vui l\xF2ng \u0111\u1EA3m b\u1EA3o r\u1EB1ng k\xEDch th\u01B0\u1EDBc t\u1EC7p \u0111\xE3 t\u1EA3i l\xEAn c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c v\u01B0\u1EE3t qu\xE1 3MB!","Bad file type":"Lo\u1EA1i t\u1EC7p sai","Empty file or bad file type, ensure your file is Eagle 6.0+":"T\u1EC7p tr\u1ED1ng ho\u1EB7c lo\u1EA1i t\u1EC7p kh\xF4ng h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7, \u0111\u1EA3m b\u1EA3o t\u1EC7p c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n l\xE0 Eagle 6.0+","This operation not supported on demo account":"Thao t\xE1c n\xE0y kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 tr\xEAn t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n demo","Can not share this file under a private project, please set the active project to public!":"Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 chia s\u1EBB t\xE0i li\u1EC7u c\xE1 nh\xE2n, h\xE3y \u0111\u1EB7t d\u1EF1 \xE1n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\xF3 l\xE0m c\xF4ng khai","Login Failed Too many attempts. If you forgot your password, please {0}reset your password{1} or send an email to support@easyeda.com":"Qu\xE1 nhi\u1EC1u l\u1ED7i v\u1EC1 m\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u, n\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n qu\xEAn m\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u, h\xE3y nh\u1EA5p v\xE0o {0} \u0110\u1EB7t l\u1EA1i m\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u {1}","Common Buttons Setting":"B\u1ED9 n\xFAt","Show/Hide":"Hi\u1EC3n th\u1ECB / \u1EA9n","Move Up":"\u0110i l\xEAn","Move Down":"\u0110i xu\u1ED1ng","Reset All":"\u0110\u1EB7t l\u1EA1i t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3","Find Libraries...":"T\xECm t\u1EC7p th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n ...","Place Pin":"\u0110\u1EB7t ghim",Permissions:"Quy\u1EC1n",Operation:"Ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng","Access Control":"Ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t truy c\u1EADp","Project Access Control":"Ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t truy c\u1EADp d\u1EF1 \xE1n",Reject:"B\u1ECB t\u1EEB ch\u1ED1i","Add User":"Th\xEAm ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng","Bad email address":"\u0110\u1ECBa ch\u1EC9 email sai","Can't find this email address in EasyEDA. Your partner must be an EasyEDA user.":"Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng kh\xF4ng t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i","Grid Background":"L\u01B0\u1EDBi n\u1EC1n","Pane Background":"N\u1EC1n n\u1EC1n","WaveForm Config":"C\u1EA5u h\xECnh d\u1EA1ng s\xF3ng","Export Waveform":"D\u1EA1ng s\xF3ng xu\u1EA5t kh\u1EA9u",dot:"d\u1EA5u ch\u1EA5m",line:"h\xE0ng","A4 Portrait":"A4 d\u1ECDc","A4 Landscape":"A4 ngang","A3 Portrait":"A3 d\u1ECDc","A3 Landscape":"A3 ngang","A2 Portrait":"A2 d\u1ECDc","A2 Landscape":"A2 ngang","A1 Portrait":"A1 d\u1ECDc","A1 Landscape":"A1 ngang",Landscape:"ngang",Portrait:"d\u1ECDc",solid:"ch\u1EA5t r\u1EAFn",dashed:"\u0111\u1EE9t",dotted:"say m\xEA","Fill Region":"V\xF9ng r\u1EAFn",Type:"Ki\u1EC3u","Report error":"B\xE1o l\u1ED7i","Please give us some information to help us find the problem.":"Vui l\xF2ng cho ch\xFAng t\xF4i m\u1ED9t g\u1EE3i \xFD \u0111\u1EC3 t\xECm th\xF4ng b\xE1o sai","Cannot place parts into this document: Schematic Symbols can only be placed into a Schematic; PCB Footprints can only be placed into a PCB.":"Lo\u1EA1i t\xE0i li\u1EC7u kh\xF4ng ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p, schematic th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EB7t tr\xEAn b\u1EA3n g\u1ED1c, g\xF3i PCB ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EB7t tr\xEAn PCB","Save it as a favorite part":"L\u01B0u n\xF3 nh\u01B0 m\u1ED9t thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB y\xEAu th\xEDch","Only logged-in users can save this component as a Favorite Part but guest (Anonymous) users can place this component into their design directly. Would you like to place this component now?":"Ch\u1EC9 nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp m\u1EDBi c\xF3 th\u1EC3 l\u01B0u n\xF3 nh\u01B0 m\u1ED9t thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB y\xEAu th\xEDch v\xE0 kh\xE1ch truy c\u1EADp \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xE9p \u0111\u1EB7t thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB v\xE0o khung v\u1EA3i v\xE0 b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 s\u1EB5n s\xE0ng \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EB7t n\xF3 ngay b\xE2y gi\u1EDD","Electronic circuit design - EasyEDA":"EasyEDA Editor - c\xF4ng c\u1EE5 thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF \u0111i\u1EC7n t\u1EED tr\u1EF1c tuy\u1EBFn, m\xF4 ph\u1ECFng PCB gi\u1EA3n \u0111\u1ED3","Find libs":"T\xECm th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n","My Projects":"D\u1EF1 \xE1n c\u1EE7a t\xF4i","My Parts":"T\u1EADp tin th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n c\u1EE7a t\xF4i","My Modules":"M\xF4-\u0111un c\u1EE7a t\xF4i","Assembly LCSC Components":"Li Chong c\xE1c b\u1ED9 ph\u1EADn SMD",Modules:"M\xF4 \u0111un","SCH Modules":"M\xF4-\u0111un Schematic","PCB Modules":"M\xF4 \u0111un PCB","System IC":"Th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng","LCSC (Official)":"Trung t\xE2m mua s\u1EAFm Li Chong","Favorite Parts":"B\u1ED9 s\u01B0u t\u1EADp thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB","Shared With Me":"Chia s\u1EBB v\u1EDBi t\xF4i",Preview:"Xem tr\u01B0\u1EDBc","Preview Window":"Xem tr\u01B0\u1EDBc c\u1EEDa s\u1ED5","System Default":"M\u1EB7c \u0111\u1ECBnh h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng","User Defined":"Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng x\xE1c \u0111\u1ECBnh",Theme:"Ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1EC1","Theme Setting":"C\xE0i \u0111\u1EB7t ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1EC1",Close:"\u0110\xF3ng",Open:"M\u1EDF",Collapse:"Thu g\u1ECDn","Toggle toolbar":"M\u1EDF / \u0111\xF3ng thanh c\xF4ng c\u1EE5","Toggle left bar":"M\u1EDF / \u0111\xF3ng c\u1ED9t b\xEAn tr\xE1i","Toggle right bar":"M\u1EDF / \u0111\xF3ng c\u1ED9t b\xEAn ph\u1EA3i",Reload:"L\xE0m m\u1EDBi","Mouse-X":"Con tr\u1ECF X","Mouse-Y":"Con tr\u1ECF Y","Mouse-DX":"Con tr\u1ECF DX","Mouse-DY":"Con tr\u1ECF DY","Bus entry x1":"Nh\u1EADp xe bu\xFDt x1","Bus entry x2":"Nh\u1EADp xe bu\xFDt x2","Bus entry y1":"Nh\u1EADp xe bu\xFDt y1","Bus entry y2":"Nh\u1EADp xe bu\xFDt y2",Yes:"C\xF3",No:"Kh\xF4ng",Cancel:"H\u1EE7y","Ask a question":"T\xECm ki\u1EBFm tr\u1EE3 gi\xFAp","Share my work":"Chia s\u1EBB c\xF4ng vi\u1EC7c c\u1EE7a t\xF4i","Go to my page":"M\u1EDF trang ch\u1EE7 c\u1EE7a t\xF4i","Bus entry":"\u0110\u1EA7u v\xE0o Bus",Filter:"B\u1ED9 l\u1ECDc",Check:"Ki\u1EC3m tra","Guest Project":"D\u1EF1 \xE1n kh\xE1ch","Insert into":"Ch\xE8n v\xE0o","Insert into {site}":"Ch\xE8n v\xE0o {site}","Upload {site}":"T\u1EA3i l\xEAn {site}","Copy the contents of this box into a text editor, then save the file. Paste the edited text back into this box and click Apply to update the display.":"Sao ch\xE9p n\u1ED9i dung c\u1EE7a h\u1ED9p v\u0103n b\u1EA3n v\xE0o m\xE1y t\xEDnh x\xE1ch tay v\xE0 l\u01B0u n\xF3. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xE1n n\u1ED9i dung \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y v\xE0 ch\u1EC9nh s\u1EEDa l\u1EA1i.","EasyEDA format":"\u0111\u1ECBnh d\u1EA1ng EasyEDA","Copy the contents of this box into a text editor, then save the file with a .svg extension. You can edit it in Inkscape or open it in your browser.":"Sao ch\xE9p n\u1ED9i dung c\u1EE7a h\u1ED9p v\u0103n b\u1EA3n v\xE0o m\xE1y t\xEDnh x\xE1ch tay v\xE0 l\u01B0u n\xF3 b\u1EB1ng \u0111u\xF4i .svg. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 ch\u1EC9nh s\u1EEDa n\xF3 b\u1EB1ng inkscape, ho\u1EB7c b\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 m\u1EDF n\xF3 b\u1EB1ng tr\xECnh duy\u1EC7t c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n.","SVG format":"\u0110\u1ECBnh d\u1EA1ng SVG","SVG File":"T\u1EC7p SVG","Description should be no more than 250 letters":"M\xF4 t\u1EA3 kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 v\u01B0\u1EE3t qu\xE1 250 k\xFD t\u1EF1","The file save operation has timed out. Try again and check your Internet connection.":"Xu\u1EA5t t\u1EADp tin m\u1EA1ng l\u01B0u ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng h\u1EBFt th\u1EDDi gian, ph\xE1t hi\u1EC7n k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i m\u1EA1ng v\xE0 th\u1EED l\u1EA1i","Export Netlist":"Xu\u1EA5t m\u1EA1ng",Notifications:"Th\xF4ng B\xE1o","Please select txt or json files.":"Vui l\xF2ng ch\u1ECDn t\u1EADp tin txt ho\u1EB7c json","Failed to read file [{file}]":"\u0110\u1ECDc t\u1EC7p [{file}] kh\xF4ng th\xE0nh c\xF4ng","[{file}] is not a valid json file":"[{file}] kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 t\u1EC7p JSON h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7","Invalid parameters!":"Tham s\u1ED1 kh\xF4ng h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7",Download:"T\u1EA3i v\u1EC1",Start:"B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u","You have unsaved files, are you sure you want to log out without saving the files?":"C\xF3 nh\u1EEFng t\u1EC7p tin ch\u01B0a \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u01B0u, b\u1ECF qua ch\xFAng v\xE0 \u0111\u0103ng xu\u1EA5t?","Please use the web version to run this function.":"Vui l\xF2ng s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng ch\u1EE9c n\u0103ng n\xE0y trong phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n web","Please save this file to you project!":"Xin l\u01B0u t\xE0i li\u1EC7u v\xE0o d\u1EF1 \xE1n","Nothing changed":"Kh\xF4ng thay \u0111\u1ED5i","Delete Node":"X\xF3a giao l\u1ED9","This layer is invisible.":"L\u1EDBp n\xE0y l\xE0 v\xF4 h\xECnh","When the fill region is NPTH, please set the layer to Multi-Layer.":"C\xE1c lo\u1EA1i l\u1ED7 kh\xF4ng m\u1EA1 kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u1EA5p \u0111\u1EA7y, c\xE1c l\u1EDBp c\u1EE7a n\xF3 ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EB7t th\xE0nh nhi\u1EC1u l\u1EDBp","You should not try to assign a net to a NPTH fill region.":"Nano kh\xF4ng m\u1EA1 th\xF4ng qua lo\u1EA1i l\u1ED7, b\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng n\xEAn \u0111\u1EB7t m\u1EA1ng.","Net Length":"Chi\u1EC1u d\xE0i m\u1EA1ng","EasyEDA allows you to place a Pin in the schematic, but don't forget to group all of the Pins to a schematic component. Please click the help button to find out how to group them. If you just want to mark the wire, please use NetPort or NetLabel.":"Pins c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EB7t tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp trong s\u01A1 \u0111\u1ED3, nh\u01B0ng \u0111\u1EEBng qu\xEAn k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p c\xE1c ch\xE2n v\xE0o th\xE0nh ph\u1EA7n. Nh\u1EA5p v\xE0o n\xFAt Tr\u1EE3 gi\xFAp \u0111\u1EC3 xem vi\u1EC7c s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng c\xE1c ch\u1EE9c n\u0103ng k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p. N\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n \u0111\xE1nh d\u1EA5u d\xE2y, s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng c\u1ED5ng m\u1EA1ng ho\u1EB7c nh\xE3n m\u1EA1ng.","Coming soon":"H\xE3y theo d\xF5i","No tool":"Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 c\xF4ng c\u1EE5","Help us translate into your language":"Gi\xFAp ch\xFAng t\xF4i d\u1ECBch",Pad:"T\u1EA5m l\xF3t","Via/Hole":"Th\xF4ng qua l\u1ED7","PCB Layers":"L\u1EDBp PCB","Order PCB":"\u0110\u1EB7t h\xE0ng PCB",Free:"Mi\u1EC5n ph\xED",Small:"Nh\u1ECF",Medium:"Trong",Big:"L\u1EDBn","Exporting as":"Xu\u1EA5t kh\u1EA9u d\u01B0\u1EDBi d\u1EA1ng","Exporting as image":"Xu\u1EA5t d\u01B0\u1EDBi d\u1EA1ng \u1EA3nh","Exporting as {0}SVG{1} file.":"Xu\u1EA5t d\u01B0\u1EDBi d\u1EA1ng t\u1EC7p {0} SVG {1}","Exporting as pdf is recommended: pdf gives good quality printed output and a small file size.":"\u0110\u1EC1 xu\u1EA5t xu\u1EA5t sang PDF, ch\u1EA5t l\u01B0\u1EE3ng in cao, k\xEDch th\u01B0\u1EDBc t\u1EC7p nh\u1ECF.","Generate Fabrication File(Gerber)":"T\u1EA1o Gerber","PenWidth-Increase":"Chi\u1EC1u r\u1ED9ng","PCB Details":"Th\xF4ng tin PCB","Gerber View":"Xem tr\u01B0\u1EDBc Gerber","Dimensions(Estimated)":"K\xEDch th\u01B0\u1EDBc (\u01B0\u1EDBc t\xEDnh)","PCB Qty":"S\u1ED1 l\u01B0\u1EE3ng PCB","Copper Weight":"\u0110\u1ED9 d\xE0y \u0111\u1ED3ng","PCB Refer Price(USD)":"Gi\xE1 tham kh\u1EA3o PCB","Estimated Delivery Time":"Th\u1EDDi gian nhanh","For your first time order,  the shipping cost will be free!":"Mi\u1EC5n ph\xED v\u1EADn chuy\u1EC3n mi\u1EC5n ph\xED!","HASL(with lead)":"Ch\xEC","LeadFree HASL-RoHS":"kh\xF4ng ch\xEC","ENIG-RoHS":"M\u1EA1 v\xE0ng","The PCB has {drcErrors} DRC errors.":"C\xF3 l\u1ED7i {DRCErrors} DRC tr\xEAn PCB","Do you want to check the DRC errors?":"B\u1EA1n c\xF3 ki\u1EC3m tra cho c\xE1c l\u1ED7i DRC?","Check DRC Errors":"Ki\u1EC3m tra l\u1ED7i DRC","Ignore and Continue":"B\u1ECF qua v\xE0 ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c","It will then redirect to the web site of a thirdparty JLCPCB with which we cooperate.Are you ready?":"Nh\u1EA3y t\u1EDBi trang web c\u1EE7a b\xEAn th\u1EE9 ba, JLCPCB, \u0111\u1EC3 x\xE1c nh\u1EADn b\u01B0\u1EDBc nh\u1EA3y?","Failed to submit your order, please contact us via support@easyeda.com for help.":"L\u1EC7nh th\u1EA5t b\u1EA1i, vui l\xF2ng li\xEAn h\u1EC7 v\u1EDBi support@easyeda.com \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c tr\u1EE3 gi\xFAp.","@@generateGerber":{Layers:"L\u1EDBp"},"Create a new Project...":"X\xE2y d\u1EF1ng m\u1EDBi...","Create a new Schematic":"S\u01A1 \u0111\u1ED3 m\u1EDBi","Create a new Schematic Lib":"Ph\xF2ng tr\u01B0ng b\xE0y m\u1EDBi","Create a new Spice Symbol":"Bi\u1EC3u t\u01B0\u1EE3ng Spice m\u1EDBi","Create a new Spice Subckt":"M\u1EA1ch \u0111i\u1EC7n Spice m\u1EDBi","Create a new PCB":"M\u1EDBi PCB","Create a new PCB Lib":"Th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n PCB m\u1EDBi","Create a new Schematic Module":"M\xF4-\u0111un m\u1EDBi","Create a new PCB Module":"M\xF4 \u0111un m\u1EDBi c\u1EE7a PCB","Export your file, then print it yourself.":"Xu\u1EA5t t\u1EADp tin v\xE0 in n\xF3","Trace width is too small":"Chi\u1EC1u r\u1ED9ng c\u1EE7a d\u1EA5u v\u1EBFt qu\xE1 nh\u1ECF","Images Attribute":"Thu\u1ED9c t\xEDnh h\xECnh \u1EA3nh","Connect Pad to Pad":"K\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i Pad Pad","Copper Area":"\u0110\u1ED3ng",Dimension:"K\xEDch th\u01B0\u1EDBc","Please check that you have used Wire and not Line to connect electrical elements.":"C\xF3 th\u1EC3 b\u1EA1n n\xEAn s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng d\xE2y nh\u01B0ng kh\xF4ng nhi\u1EC1u d\xE2y \u0111\u1EC3 k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i c\xE1c y\u1EBFu t\u1ED1 \u0111i\u1EC7n.","PCB Fabrication Prices & capabilities":"PCB ch\u1EBF t\u1EA1o Gi\xE1 c\u1EA3 v\xE0 kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng","Flip all texts on bottom layer":"L\u1EADt t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 v\u0103n b\u1EA3n tr\xEAn l\u1EDBp d\u01B0\u1EDBi c\xF9ng","EasyEDA Libs":"Th\u01B0 